<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="toc3">Dani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Danyeli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ichitabu cha Danyeli</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ichitabu cha Danyeli</para>
  <para style="mt">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Danyeli chotusimlila tsimbuli tsimlawile Danyeli mna ghamatsuwa gha ugima wake na ghamaono ghake ghayonile ahala Waisiraeli hawakalile kuna isi ya utumwa ako Babeli. Ichitabu chotulongela apfila Danyeli na sale tsake pfawang'ali womtoghola Imulungu, pfipfila cholapfa unabii kwa iwanu wali musi na kwa iwanu wa isi tsose. Ichitabu chosimulila ipfinu ipfilawile kulawa ghumwaka ghwa 605 mbaka ghumwaka ghwa 535 ahala Kiristu ng'ana yoneke baye, ahala Danyeli hayasang'ane mna utawala wa wafalume wane wa isi ya Babeli. Iwasomi wa ghumwande wotoghola ka Danyeli imwenyegho yuyo iyandike ichitabu achino ako Babeli, lekeni iwasomi wa sambi wolonga ichitabu chandikighwa hambele mna isi ya Isiraeli, mna ikaline ya keli ahala Kiristu ng'ana yoneke baye. Wamwenga wotoghola ka ichitabu achino ng'achandikighwe chose mala lumwe baye.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ichitabu cha Danyeli chandikighwa ili kuweng'a lolelo Waisiraeli iwakalile kuna isi ya utumwa na iwanu wa ipfeleko pfikutsa hawatsokala mna ghamatsuwa gha ukughaya. Imulungu kowalangusa tsingupfu tsake wafalume na iwanu iwali muisi, kubitila ipfinu ipfilawile mna ghamatsuwa gha Danyeli hayakalile mgima, na kubitila unabi wa ipfinu ipfitsolawila mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa. Kwa ukulola Ibibilia, ichitabu achino chotwapfila twetwe tumanye tsimbuli tsa ufalume wa Imulungu pfatsandikighwe mna Lilaghano lya sambi. Mfano ghumwe, mna ichitabu cha Danyeli isula ya 7.13-14 yomtabili Masiha. Mfano ghungi, ghamaono gha Danyeli gha itsimbuli tsa ghamatsuwa ighakutsa Yesu kaghalonga mna Ichitabu cha Matayo isula 24.15 na Mariki isula 13.14, pfipfila ghamaono agho gheghala na aghala ighandikighwe mna ichitabu cha ughubulo wa Yohana na unabii wa Yeremiya Danyeli 9.1-3.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mna ichitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Ichitabu chotulongela tsimbuli tsa Danyeli na sale tsake hawakalile Babeli, ahala Nebukadineza hayawile mfalume, isula ya 1-4.</para>
  <para style="io">Pfipfila ichitabu chotulongela Danyeli pfayofasili ghamaono gha mfalume Belishaza, isula ya 5.</para>
  <para style="io">Kuya ichitabu chotulongela Danyeli pfayakalile mna imango ya simba ahala Dario hayawile mfalume, isula ya 6.</para>
  <para style="io">Imulungu komghubulila Danyeli aghala ighatsolawila hambele isula ya 7-12.</para>
  <para style="io">Danyeli kolonga ghamaono meli na mana yake mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa, isula ya 7-8.</para>
  <para style="io">Danyeli kowalombela iwanu wake, na malaika Gabulieli komwidika isula ya 9.</para>
  <para style="io">Danyeli koghubula ighatsolawila hambele na ghamatsuwa gha ukutsigha isula ya 10-12.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DAN 1" />
  <para style="s">Danyeli na wayaghe ako Babeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 1:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu Yehoyakimu hayakalile mfalume wa Yuda, Nebukadneza mfalume wa Babeli kaghenda na maasikali wake kughutsingila ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu yaghutowe. <verse eid="DAN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 1:2" />IMNDEWA kamleka Yehoyakimu mfalume wa Yuda yaghoghighwe na mfalume Nebukadineza, hamwe na ipfinu pfa ing'anda ya Imulungu, naye kaghenda napfo mbaka kuna isi ya Shinari. Kuko kapfingitsa ipfinu apfo kuna ing'anda ya ukwikila ipfinu pfa Imulungu wake. <verse eid="DAN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 1:3" />Kuya mfalume kamlongela Ashipenazi, imkulu wa iwanu wa ing'anda ya chifalume yawasaghule iwana wamale wa Isiraeli iwolawa mna tsikolo tsa chifalume, na mna tsikolo tsa iwanu iwomanyika. <verse eid="DAN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 1:4" />Iwana awo waleke kuwa na chilema, wawe na pfihanga pfinoghile, na ihekima, na tsimbutsi, ili wadahe kwima mna ing'anda ya mfalume. Kuya kamlongela yawalangulitse ukwandika na kuisoma ilugha ya Wakalidayo. <verse eid="DAN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 1:5" />Imfalume ayo kalaghitsa iwana awo weng'ighwe ichijo chayakuja yeye imwenyegho, na weng'ighwe idipfai iyakunwa yeye imwenyegho, tsawabamighwa wafundighwe kwa miyaka midatu, hawomalitsa waghende wakamsang'anile mfalume. <verse eid="DAN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 1:6" />Mna iwana awo iwasaghulighwe mumo tsamna iwana wa kabila lya Yuda iwakemighwe, Danyeli, Hananiya, Mishaeli na Azaria. <verse eid="DAN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 1:7" />Imkulu wa iwanu wake iwasaghulighwe tsakaweng'a mataghwa ghangi, Danyeli kamkema Beliteshaza, Hananiya kamkema Shedraki, Mishaeli kamkema Meshaki, na Azaria kamkema Abedinego. <verse eid="DAN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 1:8" />Lekeni Danyeli kepfikitsa mna ghumoyo ghwake yaleke ukwitenda yehe kwa ukuja ichijo cha mfalume na ukunwa idipfai ya mfalume, apfo kamlomba Ashipenazi yaleke ukumwing'a. <verse eid="DAN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 1:9" />Apfo Imulungu kamtenda Ashipenazi imkulu wa iwanu iwomsang'anila mfalume yamwonele libatsi na yamtogholele Danyeli. <verse eid="DAN 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 1:10" />Imkulu wa ipfilongotsi kamlongela Danyeli, “Nene nompfuka imkulu wangu mfalume, iyalaghitse ichijo chenu na idipfai yenu, hebali yapfone ipfihanga pfenu ng'apfideghete baye ka ipfihanga pfa iwasongolo wayenu? Ukutenda apfo mtsonihonza nene nikomighwe na mfalume”. <verse eid="DAN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 1:11" />Baho Danyeli kamlongela imunu iyowemilila, iyekighwe na chlongotsi mkulu yawemilile yeye Danyeli, Hananiya, Mishaeli na Azaria, <verse eid="DAN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 1:12" />“Utughetse twetwe watumighwa wako kwa matsuwa kumi, kwa kutwing'a tsimboghambogha tuje na ghamatsi tunwe.” <verse eid="DAN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 1:13" />Kuya upfilinge ipfihanga pfetu na ipfihanga pfa iwasongolo awala iwakuja ichijo cha mfalume, na baho ulamle ka apfila pfautsakona. <verse eid="DAN 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 1:14" />Naye kawatogholela, kawaghetsa kwa matsuwa kumi. <verse eid="DAN 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 1:15" />Haghamalile matsuwa kumi, ipfihanga pfawo pfoneka pfidedemka na ng'uli tsawo tsidegheta kubita iwasongolo wose iwajile ichijo cha mfalume. <verse eid="DAN 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 1:16" />Baho imwimilitsi ayula ng'aweng'ile baye ichijo chawalaghitsighwe waje, na idipfai iyawalaghitsighwe wanwe, kaweng'a tsimboghambogha tsiliyeka. <verse eid="DAN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 1:17" />Apfo iwasongolo awo wane Imulungu kaweng'a tsimbutsi, ihekima na ukusoma na ukwandika. Naye Danyeli yang'ali yomanya ghamaono ghose na tsindoto. <verse eid="DAN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 1:18" />Ghamatsuwa aghala ghayalaghitse mfalume gha ukuwaghala hambele hake haghamalile, ichilongotsi mkulu wa awala iwasang'ane kwa mfalume kawaghala iwasongolo wose hambele ha mfalume Nebukadneza. <verse eid="DAN 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 1:19" />Naye mfalume kalonga nawo, na mna wose awo kuduhu iyeghalile na Danyeli, Hananiya Mishaeli na Azaria, apfo watogholighwa kumsang'anila mfalume. <verse eid="DAN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 1:20" />Na mna chila chinu cha ihekima na ukumanya chayawaghutsile mfalume, kawona wanogha mala kumi kubita iwaghanga na wahawi wose iwakalile mna ufalume wake. <verse eid="DAN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 1:21" />Naye Danyeli kaghendelela kusang'ana kuna ing'anda ya mfalume mbaka ghumwaka ghwa kwanza ghwa ukutawala mfalume Koreshi.<verse eid="DAN 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DAN 2" />
  <para style="s">Indoto ya mfalume Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 2:1" />Chilo chimwe mna ghumwaka ghwa keli ghwa utawala wake, mfalume Nebukadneza kalota ndoto, na indoto ayo imtenda yalangule mbaka ng'adahile ukuwasa baye. <verse eid="DAN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 2:2" />Kuya mfalume kawakema iwaghanga, iwahawi, iwotabili kwa kulola tsinondo na Wakalidayo, watse wamlongele indoto yake ilongatse. Wose watsa wema hambele hake. <verse eid="DAN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 2:3" />Mfalume kawalongela, “Nene nilota ndoto, nayo yonitenda nyalangule ng'ani, apfo nobama nimanye ilongatse.” <verse eid="DAN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 2:4" />Nawo wamlongela mfalume kwa lugha ya chiaramu, “Imulungu yakwike, ghwe mfalume! Tusimlile indoto yako natwe watumighwa wako tutsokulongela ilonga choni.” <verse eid="DAN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 2:5" />Mfalume kawalongela, “Nene nolonga ghendo, ka ng'amnongela baye indoto yanilotile, na chailonga choni mtsokanighwa pfihande pfihande na tsing'anda tsenu tsitsomwaghighwa. <verse eid="DAN 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 2:6" />Lekeni mng'anilongela indoto ayo na choni chailonga, nitsomghwekani, nitsowaliha na nitsowatenda mtunyighwe. Lelo nongeleni indoto ayo na achila chailonga.” <verse eid="DAN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 2:7" />Nawo wamwidika lwa keli walonga, “Mfalume tulongele indoto ayo natwe watumighwa wako tutsokulongela pfailonga.” <verse eid="DAN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 2:8" />Mfalume kedika kalonga, “Nomanya ghendo ka mwemwe mwobama mwongetsighwe ghumuda kwaapfila mwomanya achila chanilamle, <verse eid="DAN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 2:9" />ka ng'amnilongela indoto yangu, wose mtsohighighwa lumwe. Mwemwe mwilaghana mnibughe na mnighutsukile aku mwofikitsa chanilamle chitsoghalambuka, lelo nilongeleni indoto ayo, na nene nitsomanya ka mwodaha kunilongela chailonga choni.” <verse eid="DAN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 2:10" />Wawo wamwidika mfalume walonga, “Kuduhu imunu wowose mna isi iyodaha kutenda chaubama ghweghwe mfalume. Pfipfila kuduhu mfalume wowose, hata yang'awa mkulu pfihi, au hata yang'awa na ngupfu yachi iyadahile kuwaghutsa imbuli ka ayo iwaghanga, iwahawi, iwotabili kwa kulola tsindoto na Wakalidayo. <verse eid="DAN 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 2:11" />Ghwe mfalume, imbuli yughutsa ng'aidahika baye, kuduhu imunu iyodaha kukulongela ila imilungu iliyeka ing'aikala hamwe na iwanu.” <verse eid="DAN 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 2:12" />Mfalume hayahulike apfo kona maya ng'ani, na kaghudubuka, apfo kalaghitsa iwanu wose wa Babeli wana ihekima wakomighwe. <verse eid="DAN 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 2:13" />Baho lilaghitso lya ukuwakoma iwanu wose wana ihekima, lyenela muisi yose. Na iwanu watumighwa wawabame Danyeli na wayaghe wakomighwe.<verse eid="DAN 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Imulungu komghubulila indoto Danyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 2:14" />Kuya Danyeli kamghendela Arioko, imkulu wa iwakalitsi wa mfalume, iyalaghitsighwe yawakome iwanu wana ihekima wa Babeli, kalonga naye kwa hekima na ukwalangitsa. <verse eid="DAN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 2:15" />Kamghutsa Arioko, imkulu wa iwakalitsi wa mfalume, “Heule mfalume iyalapfile laghitso kali apfino?” Baho Arioko kamsimlila Danyeli ghose ighalawile. <verse eid="DAN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 2:16" />Kuya Danyeli kamghendela mfalume kamlomba yabete chidogho, naye katsomlongela mfalume pfailonga indoto. <verse eid="DAN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 2:17" />Kuya Danyeli hayoyile ukaye kawalongela imbuli ayo wayaghe tsina Hanania, Mishaeli na Azaria imbuli ayo, <verse eid="DAN 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 2:18" />kawalongela wamlombe Imulungu wa kulanga yawonele libatsi kwa imbuli ayo, ili Danyeli na wayaghe waleke ukukomighwa hamwe na wana ihekima wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 2:19" />Chilo chicho Imulungu kamghubulila Danyeli indoto ya mfalume mna ghamaono. Naye Danyeli kamtunya Imulungu wa kulanga, <verse eid="DAN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 2:20" />kalonga, “Taghwa lyake Imulungu litunyighwe matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa kwaapfila ihekima na ingupfu pfose pfake yeye. <verse eid="DAN 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 2:21" />Yeye kolongotsa ghamatsuwa na imisimu, kowalapfa iwafume na koweka iwafalume, koweng'a ihekima awala wana ihekima, na awala iwomanya kowongetsela ukumanya. <verse eid="DAN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 2:22" />Yeye koghubula ipfinu ipfipfisike, na ipfili pfikomu kumanyika, komanya aghala ighali mchisi, na yeye kokala mna ghumwanga. <verse eid="DAN 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 2:23" />Nolonga mighede na kukutunya Imulungu wa iwahenga wangu, kungaya ihekima na ingupfu, kunitenda nimanye achila chatukulombile ghweghwe, kwaapfila kutulangusa imbuli aila ya mfalume.”<verse eid="DAN 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danyeli kolonga indoto ilongatse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 2:24" />Kuya Danyeli kamghendela Arioko, iyalaghitsighwe na mfalume yawakome wana ihekima wa Babeli kamlongela, “Uleke kuwakoma iwanu wa Babeli wana ihekima, unighale nene hambele ha mfalume, na nene nitsomlongela indoto ilongatse.” <verse eid="DAN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 2:25" />Baho Arioko kamghala himahima Danyeli hambele ha mfalume, kamlongela, “Nimpata munu yumwe mna iwana wa Yuda iwahamishighwe ahano Babeli iyodaha kukulongela indoto ilongatse.”<verse eid="DAN 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 2:26" />Mfalume kamghutsa Danyeli pfipfila iyakemighwa Beliteshaza, “Pfihi kodaha kunilongela indoto yanilotile na mana yake?”<verse eid="DAN 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 2:27" />Danyeli kamwidika mfalume, kalonga, “Kuduhu wana ihekima, wala iwahawi, wala iwaghanga, wala iwotabili kwa ukulola tsinondo iyodaha kulonga chayaghutsile mfalume. <verse eid="DAN 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 2:28" />Lekeni kulanga kuna Imulungu iyoghubula tsimbuli itsipfisike, naye kamlangusa mfalume Nebukadneza ighatsolawila hambele, indoto na ghamaono ighakalile mwitwi mwako ghawonile mwisatsi aghano ahano.<verse eid="DAN 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 2:29" />“Ghwe mfalume, hauwasile mwisatsi mwako tsakulota ipfinu ipfitsolawila hambele, naye Imulungu iyoghubula tsimbuli itsipfisike, kakulangusa aghala ighatsolawila. <verse eid="DAN 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 2:30" />Lekeni nene sighubulilighwe baye imbuli aino ipfisike ka apfila nina hekima kubita iwanu wangi, ila nighubulighwa ili ghweghwe mfalume umanye indoto yako ilongatse, na umanye aghala ghaung'ali ukwalangula mna ghumoyo ghwako.<verse eid="DAN 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 2:31" />“Ghwe mfalume, haung'ali ulota tsakwona chinyagho chikulu, na ichibitilitse, chima hambele hako, nacho ching'ali chimeletseka ng'ani na ung'achilola choghuma wogha. <verse eid="DAN 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 2:32" />Litwi lya ichinyagho acho tsalikala lya inzahabu inoghile, imambagha yake na ghamoko ghake tsapfikala pfa fetsa, na lida lyake na ichuno chake tsa pfa shaba, <verse eid="DAN 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 2:33" />Ghamaghulu ghake tsaghakala gha chuma, na matsayo ghake ghahanganyighwa kwa chuma na dongo lya widi. <verse eid="DAN 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 2:34" />Haung'ali ulola, kwona libwe libuka lyenyegho kulawa kuchidunda bila imunu kulidonza, na ilibwe alyo litowa ghamaghulu gha ichinyagho ighakalile gha chuma na lidongo lya widi, lichibena ichinyagho acho pfihande pfihande. <verse eid="DAN 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 2:35" />Bahala ichuma achila, na lidongo lya widi, na ishaba, na ifetsa na inzahabu, pfose pfibeneka pfihande pfihande, pfiwa ka ng'umvi hanu ha ukubetela mna chipindi cha chiyangatsi, libeho lipfighulusa kutali wala ng'achikalile baye hata chihande chimwe. Na libwe alila libenile ichinyagho achila liwa dunda kulu, na limemesa isi yose.<verse eid="DAN 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 2:36" />“Ghwe mfalume, aino iyo indoto yako. Lelo tutsokulongela mana yake choni. <verse eid="DAN 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 2:37" />Ghweghwe kwa mfalume wa wafalume! Imulungu wa kulanga kakwing'a ufalume, uwetso, ingupfu na utunitso! <verse eid="DAN 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 2:38" />Kakutenda uwatawale iwanu wose, wanyama wa kubagho na wapfideghe wose wa kulanga, wose kaweka mmoko mwako, na kakutenda uwatawale wose kokose akula kwawokala. Ghweghwe kwa litwi alila lya inzahabu! <verse eid="DAN 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 2:39" />Ung'alawa ghweghwe utsakutsa ufalume ungi, lekeni ufalume awo utsakuwa wahela ngupfu ka wakwako. Hambele utsakutsa ufalume wakadatu, ufalume wa ishaba, nawo utsotawala isi yose. <verse eid="DAN 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 2:40" />Kuya utsakutsa ufalume wakane, awo una ngupfu ka ichuma. Ka apfila ichuma pfachihondahonda na kubenabena chila chinu, pfipfo ufalume awo pfautsobenabena na kupfulugha chila chinu ichitendeke mna tsifalume tsifosile. <verse eid="DAN 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 2:41" />Pfipfila tsakwona ghamatsayo na ipfidole pfa ichinyagho acho, pfifinighwa chidogho kwa chuma, na chidogho kwa dongo lya widi. Apfo ufalume awo utseghola, lekeni chidogho utsakuwa na ngupfu ka tsa chuma, kwaapfila ichuma tsachihanganyika na lidongo lya widi. <verse eid="DAN 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 2:42" />Ka apfila ipfidole pfake pfa mmaghulu tsapfifinighwa kwa ukuhanganya chidogho chuma na chidogho lidongo lya widi, pfipfo ufalume awo chidogho utsakuwa na ngupfu na chidogho utsakuwa wahela ngupfu. <verse eid="DAN 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 2:43" />Ka apfila pfawonile ichuma pfachihanganyike na lidongo, iwanu wa ufalume awo watsehanganya kwa ukuwakwela iwanu wa isi tsingi, lekeni ng'awatsodaha baye ukuwa chinu chimwe, ka apfila ichuma pfang'achidaha baye kuwa chinu chimwe na lidongo. <verse eid="DAN 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 2:44" />Mna ghamatsuwa gha iwafalume awo, Imulungu wa kulanga katsakwimisa ufalume ungi, ufalume awo ng'autsohinyighwa baye, wala iwanu wa isi tsingi ng'awatsouboka baye, lekeni ufalume awo utsobenabena tsifalume atso tsose, nawo utsokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="DAN 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 2:45" />Ka apfila pfawonile libwe libuka lyenyegho bila imunu kulidonza, na ilibwe alyo libena chinyagho ichifinighwe na ichuma, ishaba, lidongo lya widi, ifetsa na nzahabu, lelo Imulungu iyali mkulu kakughubulila aghala ighotsolawila hambele. Aino iyo indoto yako ghendo nayo yolongesa.”<verse eid="DAN 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume komghweka Danyeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="DAN 2:46" />Baho mfalume Nebukadneza kamwinamila Danyeli mbaka uhanga udonza hasi, kalaghitsa wamlapfile tsiinambiko na wamdusulile ubani unung'ila ghoya. <verse eid="DAN 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DAN 2:47" />Mfalume kamlongela Danyeli, “Imulungu wenu yuyo Mulungu wa milungu yose na Mndewa wa iwafulume, yeye kodaha kughubula aghala ighapfisike, kwaapfila ghweghwe kudaha kunighubulila imbuli aino ipfisike.” <verse eid="DAN 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DAN 2:48" />Kuya mfalume Nebukadneza kamtunitsa Danyeli, kamwing'a nzawadi nyingi na ng'ulung'ulu, na kamwika yawe mtawala wa ghumkowa ghose ghwa Babeli na mkulu wa iwanu wana ihekima wose wa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DAN 2:49" />Naye Danyeli kamlomba mfalume yaweke Shedraki, Meshaki na Abedinegho wawe pfilongotsi wakulu mna ghumkowa ghwa Babeli, naye mfalume kamtogholela, lekeni yeye Danyeli kaghendelela ukukala mna ing'anda ya chifalume.<verse eid="DAN 2:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DAN 3" />
  <para style="s">Nebukadneza kolaghitsa iwanu watambikile ichinyagho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 3:1" />Mfalume Nebukadneza kafina chinyagho cha nzahabu, chimo chake mita ishilini na saba na ughatsi wake mita ndatu, kachimitsa hana isi ya chiwala cha Dula mna ghumkowa ghwa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 3:2" />Kuya mfalume katuma wanu wakawakeme maliwali, wemilitsi, washauli, iwolola tsihatsina, walamlitsi wakulu na walamlitsi wadodo, na iwakulu wa imikowa, watse kuna ichihungo cha ukwanza ukutambikila ichinyagho chayemitse. <verse eid="DAN 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 3:3" />Baho, maliwali, iwemilitsi, washauri, iwolola tsihatsina, iwalamlitsi wakulu na walamlitsi wadodo, na iwakulu wa imikowa wetingana hamwe na wema hambele ha ichinyagho chayemitse mfalume Nebukadneza. <verse eid="DAN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 3:4" />Baho mtowa mbila kakema lukemwo kalonga, “Mwemwe iwanu wa makabila ghose, na iwanu wa tsiisi tsose na iwanu wa lugha tsose mwolaghitsighwa apfino, <verse eid="DAN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 3:5" />hamtsohulika malati, chimbeta, chilimba, santuri, nzumari na tsingoma tsotowighwa mwobamighwa mghwe hasi na mchitambikile ichinyagho cha nzahabu ichimitsighwe na mfalume Nebukadneza. <verse eid="DAN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 3:6" />Munu wowose iyolema kughwa hasi na kuchitambikila, baho katsakwasighwa mna litanulu ilikwaka ghumoto.” <verse eid="DAN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 3:7" />Apfo iwanu wose hawaulike imalati, ichimbeta, ichilimba, santuri, nzumari na tsingoma tsotowingwa waghwa hasi na kuchitambikila ichinyagho ichimitsighwe na mfalume Nebukadneza.<verse eid="DAN 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sale tsake Danyeli wakwing'ighwa ghomba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 3:8" />Baho wakaldayo wamwenga wawapfughulila lighomba wayahudi. <verse eid="DAN 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 3:9" />Wamlongela mfalume Nebukadneza, “Ghweghwe mfalume, Imulungu yakwike ukale matsuwa ghose! <verse eid="DAN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 3:10" />Ghweghwe Mfalume tsakulaghitsa chila munu iyatsohulika imalati, chimbeta, chilimba, zeze, filimbi, tsumari na ngoma tsotowingwa yaghwe hasi na kuchitamanila chinyagho chila cha nzahabu, <verse eid="DAN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 3:11" />na imunu wowose iyolema kughwa hasi na kuchitambikila ichinyagho acho, yasighwe mna litanulu ilikwaka ghumoto. <verse eid="DAN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 3:12" />Lelo, kuna wayahudi wamwenga yuwekile wawe pfilongotsi wakulu mna ghumkowa ghwa Babeli, awala tsina Shedraki, Meshaki na Abedinego, ghwe mfalume, iwanu awano walema kukinda lilaghitso lyako. Walema kuitumikila milungu yako na kutamanila chinyagho chila cha inzahabu chawimitse.” <verse eid="DAN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 3:13" />Baho mfalume Nebukadneza kwona maya na kaghudubuka, kalaghitsa Shadraki, Meshaki, na Abednego waghalighwe hambele hake. Na iwanu awo waghalighwa kuna yeye. <verse eid="DAN 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 3:14" />Mfalume Nebukadneza kawaghutsa, “Apfi chanihulike cholengesa ka mwemwe Shadraki, Meshaki na Abednego mlema kuitumikila imulungu yangu wala kuchitambikila chinyagho achila cha inzahabu chanichimitse? <verse eid="DAN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 3:15" />Lelo itsakuwa ng'apfu kuna mwemwe ka hamtsohulika imalati, filimbi, chilimba, zeze, santuli, zumali na tsingoma tsotowighwa mtsotoghola ukughwa hasi na kuchitambikila ichinyagho chanitengenetse, lekeni ka mtsolema, baho mtsakwasighwa mna litanulu ilikwaka ghumoto. Apfi mulungu wachi iyodaha kuwakombolani mna ghamoko ghangu?” <verse eid="DAN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 3:16" />Baho, Shadraki, Meshaki na Abednego wamwidika mfalume walonga, “Ghweghwe Nebukadneza, mna alino twetwe twahela cha kukwidika. <verse eid="DAN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 3:17" />Ka apfo pfipfo pfaili, Imulungu wetu yatumtumikila kodaha kutukombola kulawa kuna litanulu ilikwaka ghumoto, na katsotukombola kulawa kuna ghamoko ghako. <verse eid="DAN 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 3:18" />Lekeni hata ka ng'atsotukombola baye, twobama ghwe mfalume umanye ghendo ka twetwe ng'atutsoitumikila baye imilungu yako, wala kuchitambikila ichinyagho chako cha nzahabu chawimitse.”<verse eid="DAN 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sale tsake Danyeli wohighighwa ukufa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 3:19" />Baho mfalume Nebukadneza kawaghudubukila tsina Shedraki, Meshaki na Abedinego mbaka ichihanga chake chiwa chidung'u. Apfo kalaghitsa ghumoto ghongetsighwe mala saba kubita apfila pfaghwakagha. <verse eid="DAN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 3:20" />Kuya kalaghitsa maasikali wana tsingupfu kubita wose kulawa mna maasikali wake, wawohe tsina Shedraki, Meshaki na Abedinego na wawase mna litanulu ilikwaka ghumoto. <verse eid="DAN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 3:21" />Apfo iwanu awo wohighwa aku wapfala suluwali tsawo, magwanda ghawo, tsikanzu tsawo, na pfilemba pfawo, na mabwende ghao ghangi. <verse eid="DAN 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 3:22" />Kwaapfila laghitso lya mfalume tsakali ng'ani, na ghumoto ghung'ali ghukwaka ng'ani, imilambi ya ghumoto iwalakatsa na kuwakoma iwanu iwawengitse tsina Shedraki, Meshaki na Abedinego mna litanulu. <verse eid="DAN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 3:23" />Apfo iwanu awala wadatu Shedraki, Meshaki na Abedinego wasighwa mna litanulu ilikwaka ghumoto aku wohighwa. <verse eid="DAN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 3:24" />Baho mfalume Nebukadneza kakangawala, kenuka himahima kawaghutsa pfilongotsi wake, “Apfi ng'atuwohile wanu wadatu baye na kuwasa mna ghumoto?” Nawo wamwidika, “Ona, pfipfo ghwe mfalume!” <verse eid="DAN 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 3:25" />Kuya kawedika kalonga, “Lola nene nakwona wanu wane ng'awohighwe baye woghendaghenda mna ghumoto, nawo ng'awalakale baye, na munu wa kane kakoneka ka mwana wa imilungu!”<verse eid="DAN 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iwasongolo wadatu wolekelelighwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 3:26" />Apfo mfalume Nebukadneza kasoghela hana ghumlango ghwa litanulu ilikwaka ghumoto kawakemelela, Shedraki, Meshaki na Abednego, iwatumighwa wa Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani, laweni mtse ahano! Nawo walawa mna ghumoto. <verse eid="DAN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 3:27" />Na Maliwali, wemilitsi, wakulu wa tsiiisi, washauli wa mfalume iwetingane hamwe, wawona iwanu awala ghumuto ng'aghuwalakatse baye tsing'uli tsawo, wala tsimvili tsa ghamatwi ghawo, wala ghamabwende ghawo, wala ng'awanung'ile ghomoto baye. <verse eid="DAN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 3:28" />Mfalume Nebukadneza kalonga, “Yatunyighwe Imulungu wa Shedraki, Meshaki na Abedinego iyamtumile imalaika wake yatse yawakombole iwatumighwa wake iwamtoghole. Wawo walema kukinda lilaghitso lyangu nene mfalume, watoghola ukufa kubita kuitumikila milungu ingi, wala kuitambikila, ila wamtumikile Imulungu wawo yaliyeka. <verse eid="DAN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 3:29" />Apfo nakwika laghitso kwa chila kabila lya iwanu, na kwa chila iwanu wa isi, na kwa chila lugha yoyose, iwatsomlonga pfihile Imulungu wa Shedraki, Meshaki na Abedinego, watsokanighwa pfihande pfhande, na tsing'anda tsawo tsitsomwaghighwa na kuwa pfilundo, kwaapfila kuduhu mulungu yungi yodaha kukombola apfino.” <verse eid="DAN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 3:30" />Kuya mfalume Nebukadneza kaweka tsina Shadraki, Meshaki na Abedinego wawe pfilongotso wakulu mna ghumkowa ghwa Babeli.<verse eid="DAN 3:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DAN 4" />
  <para style="s">Indoto ya keli ya mfalume Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 4:1" />Nene mfalume Nebukadineza nomwandikilani iwanu wa ghamakabila ghose, iwanu wa tsiisi tsose, na iwanu wa lugha tsose iwokala muisi yose, nolonga mkale tseghamba. <verse eid="DAN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 4:2" />Nene mbona pfinogha niwalongele ipfitango na ipfinu pfa ukukangawatsa pfayanitendele Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani. <verse eid="DAN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 4:3" />Pfitango pfake pfikulu na ipfinu pfake pfa ukukangawatsa napfo pfikulu ng'ani! Ufalume wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, na ukulu wake wokala kulawa lweleko lumwe mbaka lweleko lungi. <verse eid="DAN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 4:4" />Nene Nebukadineza tsanikala mna ing'anda yangu ya ufalume aku niyanzala na nobweda. <verse eid="DAN 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 4:5" />Haniwasile mwisatsi mwangu nilota ndoto initendile nipfuke, ghamawatso na ghamaono ighakalile mwitwi mwangu ghanitenda nyalangule. <verse eid="DAN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 4:6" />Apfo nilaghitsa iwanu wose wa Babeli wana ihekima waghalighwe hambele hangu ili wanongele indoto aila ilonga choni. <verse eid="DAN 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 4:7" />Baho wengila iwaghanga, iwahawi, Wakalidayo, na awala iwotabili kwa kulola tsinondo, na niwasimlila indoto yangu lekeni ng'awadahile baye ukunongela ilonga choni. <verse eid="DAN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 4:8" />Kuya katsa Danyeli iyakemighwe Beliteshaza, litaghwa lya imulungu wangu, na mghati mwake yokala loho ya imilungu iyelile, na nene nimsimlila indoto aila, nilonga, <verse eid="DAN 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 4:9" />Ghwe Beliteshaza yuli mkulu wa iwaghanga, nomanya ka iloho ya imilungu iyelile ya mghati mwako, wala kuduhu imbuli ipfisika kuna ghweghwe. Unongele indoto yangu yanilotile na choni chailonga. <verse eid="DAN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 4:10" />Indoto yanilotile haniwasile mlusatsi mwangu ikala apfino, haghati ghati ha isi mbona mbiki mtali ng'ani. <verse eid="DAN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 4:11" />Ghumbiki agho ghukula na ghuneneha, utali wake upfika mbaka kulanga, na ghung'ali ghukoneka chila hanu mna isi yose. <verse eid="DAN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 4:12" />Imitsani yake tsaidegheta, ghukala na matunda mengi ighaweneletse iwanu wose. Ghuweng'a chimbeho iwanyama wose wa kubagho, na wapfideghe wa kulanga wang'ali wokala mna ghamaputila ghake. Pfilumbe pfose tsapfipata ichijo kulawa kuna ghumbiki agho.<verse eid="DAN 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 4:13" />“Mna ghamaono ghambonile haniwasile mlutsatsi mwangu, mbona malaika iyelile kohulumka kulawa kulanga, <verse eid="DAN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 4:14" />kakemelela kalonga, ‘Ghukaneni ghumbiki aghuno na mghasangule ghamaputila ghake, muhulule imitsani yake na ghamatunda ghake mghapwililise, wanyama wali hasi ha ghumbiki agho watsume woke, na wapfideghe wali mna ghamaputila ghake waghuluke woke. <verse eid="DAN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 4:15" />Lekeni mchileke ichisiki cha lisina lyake mna lidongo aku chohighwa kwa tsipingu tsa chuma na shaba mna imitsani mibisi ili mlukonde.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:15">“‘Chilekeni chipate ghamatsi kwa litungwe lya kulanga, chilekeni chikale hamwe na iwanyama wa kubagho hamwe na imitsani ili muisi. <verse eid="DAN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 4:16" />Ghumoyo ghwake ghughaluke ghuleke kuwa moyo ghwa imunu, ila yeng'ighwe moyo ghwa mnyama, na yakale pfipfo mbaka ipfike miyaka saba. <verse eid="DAN 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 4:17" />Malaika wawo iwahighile apfino, na iwelile wawo iwalamle apfino, ili iwanu wose wamanye ka Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani yuyo iyotawala mna tsifalume tsa iwanu, naye komwing'a ufalume imunu wowose iyombama, kuya komtenda imunu iyali nyondenyonde yautawale.’<verse eid="DAN 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 4:18" />“Aino iyo indoto yanilotile nene mfalume Nebukadneza.” “Lelo ghweghwe Beliteshaza nongele ilonga choni, kwaapfila iwanu wana ihekima iwali mna ufalume wangu wose ng'awodaha baye kunilongela, ila ghweghwe kodaha kwaapfila iloho ya imilungu iyelile yokala mghati mwako.”<verse eid="DAN 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danyeli kolonga mana ya indoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 4:19" />Baho Danyeli iyakemighwe Beliteshaza tanu kakangawala na kengila wogha. Mfalume kamlongela, “Ghwe Beliteshaza indoto aino, wala mana ya indoto ileke kukutenda ukangawale!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 4:19">Beliteshaza kedika, kalonga, “Ghwe Imndewa wangu ng'apfu indoto aino iwapate awala iwokwihila, na mana ya indoto iwapate maaduwi tsako. <verse eid="DAN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 4:20" />Ghumbiki mkulu aghula na ghumkomu ghwaughonile, na utali wake upfikile mbaka kulanga, na ighoneke chila hanu musi, <verse eid="DAN 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 4:21" />ghukalile na imitsani yake ideghete na matunda mengi gha ukweneletsa iwanu wose, na hasi hake iwanyama wapata chimbeho, na mna ghamaputila ghake wang'ali wokala wapfideghe wa kulanga.<verse eid="DAN 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 4:22" />“Ghwe mfalume ghweghwe yuyo mbiki aghula, ighukulile na kuwa na ngupfu, na ukulu wako upfika mbaka kulanga, na utawala wako wenela mna isi yose. <verse eid="DAN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 4:23" />Kuya, ghwe mfalume, kwaapfila tsakumwona imkalitsi kulawa kulanga kohulumka, kolonga, ‘Ghukaneni ghumbiki aghuno na kughuhinya, lekeni mchileke ichisiki imitsitsi ya lisina lyake mna lidongo aku chohighwa kwa pingu ya chuma na shaba mna imitsani mibisi ili mlukonde, chipate ghamatsi kwa litungwe lya kulanga, chilekeni chikale hamwe na iwanyama wa kubagho mbaka ibite miyaka saba.’<verse eid="DAN 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 4:24" />“Lelo, ghwe mfalume aino iyo mana ya indoto yako, ka apfila Imulungu mkulu yali kuchanya ng'ani pfayalaghitse ikulawile ghweghwe mndewa wangu mfalume. <verse eid="DAN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 4:25" />Ghweghwe kutsowingighwa ughende kutali na tsikaye tsa iwanu! Kutsokala na iwanyama wa kubagho, na kutsonanayitsighwa uje imitsani ka ing'ombe, naghwe kutsopfulumka kwa litungwe lya kulanga. Kutsokala pfipfo kwa miyaka saba, mbaka hautsomanya ka Imulungu mkulu iyali kuchanya ng'ani yuyo iyotawala mna tsifalume tsose tsa iwanu, naye komwing'a ufalume imunu wowose iyombama. <verse eid="DAN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 4:26" />Na kwaapfila tsawalaghitsa wachileke ichisiki cha lisina lyake, ufalume wako utsakuwa na ngupfu ahala hautsomanya ka Imulungu iyali kuchanya yuyo iyotawala. <verse eid="DAN 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 4:27" />Lelo ghwe mfalume utegheletse na utoghole chanilonga, uleke tsinzambi tsako, utende aghala ighali gha haki, uleke kutenda ighehile, uwonele libatsi iwanu wahingwa songaha ghamatsuwa ghako gha ukubweda ghatsakongetsighwa.”<verse eid="DAN 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 4:28" />Agho ghose ghamlawila mfalume Nebukadneza. <verse eid="DAN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 4:29" />Haipfikile miyetsi kumi na mili, mfalume Nebukadneza yang'ali yakwanga mchiswili cha ing'anda ya chifalume chikalile ka chibwalu ili mna ghumji ghwa Babeli. <verse eid="DAN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 4:30" />Mfalume kalonga, “Ng'ambe ghumji aghuno mkulu ghwa Babeli ghwanitsengile kwa ngupfu tsangu ghuwe kaye yangu ya chifalume ili ufalume wangu utunyighwe!”<verse eid="DAN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 4:31" />Ng'ana yamalitse ukulonga apfo, kahulika litsi kulawa kulanga, lilonga, “Ghwe mfalume Nebukadneza, aghano igholongighwa kolongelighwa ghweghwe! Ghweghwe kubokighwa ufalume wako! <verse eid="DAN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 4:32" />Ghweghwe watsokuwinga ughende kutali na iwanu! Kutsokala hamwe na iwanyama wa kubagho, na kutsakuja imitsani ka ng'ombe! Kutsokala pfipfo kwa miyaka saba mbaka hautsomanya ka Imulungu mkulu iyali kuchanya ng'ani yuyo iyotawala mna tsifalume tsa iwanu, naye komwing'a ufalume imunu wowose iyombama.”<verse eid="DAN 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 4:33" />Baho imbuli ayo itimila, Nebukadneza kawingighwa yaghende kutali na iwanu, yang'ali yakuja mitsani ka ng'ombe. Na ilukuli lwake lupfulumka kwa litungwe lya kulanga, hata tsimvili tsake tsikula na tsidimka ka mighala ya magengele, na tsinumba tsake ka tsa chideghe.<verse eid="DAN 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nebukadneza komtunya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 4:34" />“Imiyaka ila saba haimalile, nene Nebukadneza nyinula tsinenge nilola kulanga, na baho tsimbutsi tsangu tsimbuyila. Tsanimlongela mighede Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani yokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">Ukulu wake wokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:34">na ufalume wake wokala lweleko mbaka lweleko.<verse eid="DAN 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 4:35" />Na iwanu wose iwokala muisi wakoneka si chinu baye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">naye kotenda ka pfayobama kuna ipfiumbe wa kulanga na iwanu iwokala muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">Haduhu munu iyodaha kumghoma ukutenda chinu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 4:35">wala iyodaha kumghutsa chotenda.<verse eid="DAN 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 4:36" />“Baho tsimbutsi tsangu tsimbuyila, na nibokela keli ukulu wangu ka mfalume, apfo iwanu wanza kunitunya ka mfalume mkulu, iwashauli wangu na pfilongotsi wangu wakulu watsa kunibama na mbuyitsighwa mna ufalume wangu, na nene tsa niwa mkulu kubita aho mwanduso.<verse eid="DAN 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 4:37" />“Lelo nene Nebukadneza nomtunya na nomtegheletsa mfalume wa kulanga. Kwaapfila ghamatendo ghake ghose gholongesa na tsinzila tsake tsigholoka na kowahulumsa hasi awala iweghoda.”<verse eid="DAN 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DAN 5" />
  <para style="s">Belishaza kowakema iwanu kuna ichijo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 5:1" />Tsuwa limwe mfalume Belishaza kawatendela chihungo chikulu wapfilongotsi wake elufu imwe, na kanwa idipfai hamwe nawo. <verse eid="DAN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 5:2" />Belishaza hayang'ali yolanza idipfai aila, kalaghitsa iwanu wapfighale ipfinu apfila pfa nzahabu na ifetsa pfayasolile aba wake Nebukadneza kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu ili yeye mfalume, iwakulu wake, iwapinga wake, na wapfimada wake wapfinwele. <verse eid="DAN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 5:3" />Baho wapfighala ipfinu apfila pfa nzahabu na fetsa ipfisolighwe kuna ing'anda ya Imulungu ako Yerusalemu. Naye mfalume, iwakulu wake, wapinga wake na pfimada wake wapfinwela. <verse eid="DAN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 5:4" />Wang'ali wakunwa idipfai aku woitunya imilungu itengenetsighwe kwa nzahabu, fetsa, ishaba, chuma, imibiki na ghamabwe.<verse eid="DAN 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 5:5" />Baho pfidole pfa ghumoko ghwa munu pfilawila na pfandusa ukwandika mna ubanda wa ing'anda ya mfalume habehi na chighutso cha itala. Mfalume kona ichighanza cha ghumoko agho ighung'ali ghukwandika. <verse eid="DAN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 5:6" />Baho ichihanga chake chighaluka, ilukuli lwake lukeng'eneka, na ghamaghoti ghake ghang'ali ghoghudema. <verse eid="DAN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 5:7" />Mfalume Nebukadneza kakemelela, kalaghitsa iwahawi, Wakalidayo, wana ihekima, na iwotabili kwa ukulola tsinondo waghalighwe hambele hake. Naye kawalongela iwanu wa Babeli wana ihekima, “Munu wowose yodaha kusoma aghano ighandikighwe na kunongela mana yake katsopfatsighwa tsinguwo tsa langi ya nzambalau, na mkufwi ghwa nzahabu msingo mwake, naye katsakuwa chilongotsi wa kadatu mna ufalume wangu.” <verse eid="DAN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 5:8" />Baho iwanu wose wa mfalume wana ihekima wapfika, lekeni ng'awadahile baye kughasoma aghala ighandikighwe, wala kumlongela mfalume mana yake. <verse eid="DAN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 5:9" />Kuya mfalume Belishaza ichihanga chake chighaluka, na iwakulu wake wang'ali wopfuka. <verse eid="DAN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 5:10" />Malikiya, mai wake mfalume, hayahulike mfalume na iwakulu wake wakowela kengila mna ichikuta mwachili ichijo kalonga, “Ghwe mfalume ukale matsuwa ghose! Uleke kwiduka wala ichihanga chileke kughaluka! <verse eid="DAN 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 5:11" />Mna ufalume wako, mna munu yana iloho ya imilungu iyelile mghati mwake. Aba wako hayang'ali yotawala, imunu ayo koneka komanya pfinu pfingi, kana tsimbutsi na ihekima ka aila ya milungu. Aba wako, mfalume Nebukadineza kamtenda yawe mkulu wa iwaghanga, iwahawi, iwotabili kwa kulola tsinondo, na Wakaldayo wana ihekima. <verse eid="DAN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 5:12" />Imunu ayo taghwa lyake Danyeli, lekeni aba wako kamkema Beliteshaza, yeye tsakakengela ng'ani, na yang'ali yomanya pfinu pfingi, yang'ali yolonga mana ya indoto, yangali yolonga imbuli ipfisike, na yang'ali yotenda ipfinu ing'apfidahika. Lelo umkeme naye katsokulongela mana ya aghano ighandikighwe.”<verse eid="DAN 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Danyeli kolonga ighandikighwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 5:13" />Baho Danyeli kaghalighwa hambele ha mfalume, naye mfalume kamghutsa: “Angu ghweghwe yuyo Danyeli, yumwe wa iwanu iwaghalighwe na aba wangu mfalume kulawa kuna isi ya Yuda? <verse eid="DAN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 5:14" />Nihulika ka iloho ya imilungu iyelile ya mghati mwako, na komanya pfinu pfingi, kuna tsimbutsi na kuna ihekima. <verse eid="DAN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 5:15" />Iwanu wana ihekima na iwahawi waghalighwa hambele hangu wanisomele aghano ighandikighwe, lekeni ng'awadahile baye. <verse eid="DAN 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 5:16" />Lelo nihulika ka ghweghwe kodaha kutafasiri tsimbuli tsipfisike, na kolonga tsimbuli ing'atsidahika, ka kodaha kusoma aghano ghandikighwe na kunongela mana yake kutsopfatsighwa inguwo ya langi ya nzambalau na mkufwi ghwa nzahabu msingo mwako. Naghwe kutsakuwa munu wa kadatu kwa ukulu mna ufalume wangu.”<verse eid="DAN 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 5:17" />Baho Danyeli kamwidika mfalume Belishaza kalonga, “Ghwe mfalume, tsinzawadi tsako ukale natso ghumwenyegho, au umwing'e munu yungi. Lekeni nene nitsokusomela aghano ighandikighwe na nitsokulongela gholonga choni.<verse eid="DAN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 5:18" />“Ghwe mfalume, Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani kamwing'a aba wako Nebukadineza ufalume, ukulu, na kamtenda yatunyighwe na yatunitsighwe. <verse eid="DAN 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 5:19" />Kwaapfila kamwing'a ukulu aba wako, iwanu wa tsikabila tsose, iwanu wa tsiisi tsose, na iwanu wa lugha tsose waghudema na wampfuka. Mfalume Nebukadneza kamkoma imunu wowose yabamile kumkoma, na kamleka mgima imunu wowose yabamile kumleka mgima. Ayala iyabamile kumtenda yawe mkulu tsakamtenda yawe mkulu, na awala iyabamile kuwahulumsa tsakawahulumsa. <verse eid="DAN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 5:20" />Lekeni hayanduse kuwa msughu na ukwighoda, kalapfighwa mna ichighoda chake cha ufalume na kabokighwa mkufwi ghwake. <verse eid="DAN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 5:21" />Kawingighwa yakale kutali na iwanu, na ghumoyo ghwake ghutendighwa ghuwe ka ghwa mnyama, tsakakala na pfihongwe wa kubagho, na yang'ali yakuja imitsani ka ing'ombe, naye kapfulumka kwa litungwe lya kulanga. Kakala pfipfo kwa miyaka saba mbaka hayamanyile ka Imulungu mkulu iyali kuchanya ng'ani yuyo iyotawala mna tsifalume tsose tsa iwanu, naye komwing'a ufalume imunu wowose iyombama.<verse eid="DAN 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 5:22" />“Lekeni Ghwe Belishaza, kwa imwanghe, hata ka agho ghose tsakughamanya, ng'wihulumse baye. <verse eid="DAN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 5:23" />Ila ghweghwe kwitenda mkulu kubita IMNDEWA wa kulanga, wakughalila ipfinu pfa Ing'anda ya Imulungu, naghwe kupfinwela dipfai ghweghwe, iwakulu wako, iwapinga wako, na wapfimada wako, na kuitunya imilungu itendighwe kwa fetsa, nzahabu, ishaba, chuma, imibiki na ghamabwe. imilungu ing'aikona, ing'aihulika, wala ukumanya chochose. Lekeni ghweghwe ng'aumtoghole baye Imulungu iyokwing'a ughima na iyokona chila chinu chautenda. <verse eid="DAN 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 5:24" />Apfo Imulungu yuyo iyatumile ichighanza achila cha ghumoko chandike aghano.<verse eid="DAN 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 5:25" />“Naye kandika apfino, ‘MENE, MENE, TEKELI, NA PERESI.’ <verse eid="DAN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 5:26" />MENE mana yake, ghamatsuwa gha ufalume wako Imulungu kaghapeta, na kaghatenda ghatsighe. <verse eid="DAN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 5:27" />TEKELI mana yake wakulinga mna ghumzani naghwe koneka kwa mbewe. <verse eid="DAN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 5:28" />PERESI mana yake ufalume wako waughola, na waweng'a Wamedi na Waajemi.”<verse eid="DAN 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 5:29" />Baho mfalume Belishaza kalaghitsa Danyeli yapfatsighwe tsinguwo tsa langi ya nzambal ao na mkufwii ghwa nzahabu msingo mwake. Na ilongighgwa ka Danyeli kakuwa munu wa kadatu mna ufalume wake. <verse eid="DAN 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 5:30" />Na chilo chicho Belishaza mfalume wa Babeli kakomighwa, <verse eid="DAN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 5:31" />naye Dario wa isi ya Umedi kawa mfalume aku kana miyaka sitini na mili.<verse eid="DAN 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DAN 6" />
  <para style="s">Danyeli mna lipondo lya simba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 6:1" />Mfalume Dario kona pfinogha yasaghule maliwali miya na ishilini ili wamwapfile mna ufalume wake wose. <verse eid="DAN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 6:2" />Pfipfila kawasaghula iwakulu wadatu, naye Danyeli tsa yumwe wa iwakulu awo, wawo wawemilitse iwakulu awala ili chila chinu chitendeke ghoya. <verse eid="DAN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 6:3" />Matsuwa chidogho hambele Danyeli koneka kosang'ana pfinoghile kubita iwakulu wemilitsi na kubita iwakulu awala wose kwaapfila iloho iyelile tsaikala mghati mwake. Apfo mfalume kamtenda yawe mkulu mna ufalume wose. <verse eid="DAN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 6:4" />Baho iwakulu awala na iwemilitsi wabama nzila ya ukumpfughulila ghomba Danyeli kwa tsisang'ano tsake tsayang'ali yotenda lekeni ng'awapatile baye. Danyeli tsakakala kahela totso, wala ng'atendile chinu chochose chihile baye kwaapfila yeye tsakakala munu wa ukutogholighwa. <verse eid="DAN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 6:5" />Baho iwanu awala walonga, “Ng'atudaha baye kupata nzila yoyose ya ukumpfughulila ghomba Danyeli, ila tulole mna ghamalaghitso ighoghomighwa gha Imulungu wake.” <verse eid="DAN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 6:6" />Apfo iwakulu awala na iwemilitsi wamghendela mfalume walonga, “Ghwe mfalume Dario, Imulungu yakwike, ukale matsuwa ghose! <verse eid="DAN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 6:7" />Twetwe, wemilitsi, maliwali, walamlitsi na iwakulu wa isi twilaghana apfino, twakona pfinogha ulapfe laghitso na chila munu yalikinde. Naghwe ulaghitse apfino, Kwa matsuwa selasini kuleke kuwa na munu wowose yatsolekelelighwa yalombe chinu kwa Imulungu au kwa munu wowose ila yakulombe ghweghwe. Imunu wowose ing'ayokinda lilaghitso alyo katsakwasighwa mna lipondo lya simba. <verse eid="DAN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 6:8" />Lelo ghwe mfalume wandike lilaghitso alino, na wike ghumuhuli ghwa litaghwa lyako, nalyo litsakuwa laghitso lya Wamedi na Waajemi, na laghitso alyo likaleghe pfipfo.” <verse eid="DAN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 6:9" />Baho mfalume Dario keka ghumhuli kwa litaghwa lyake. <verse eid="DAN 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 6:10" />Danyeli hayatangile ka lilaghitso alila lilapfighwa, koya ukaye yake kuna ichiheleto chake china ghamadilisha ighalolile Yerusalemu. Danyeli ka pfayatendagha, katowa magoti mala ndatu kamlomba Imulungu wake na kulonga mighede. <verse eid="DAN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 6:11" />Baho iwanu awala wetingana hamwe, wengila mng'anda, wampfika Danyeli komlomba Imulungu wake. <verse eid="DAN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 6:12" />Kuya wose waghenda kwa mfalume Dario walonga imbuli ya lilaghitso lya mfalume, “Ghwe mfalume, ng'ambe tsakulaghitsa kwa matsuwa selasini imunu wowose yatsomlomba chinu Imulungu au imunu na si kuna ghweghwe baye, imunu ayo katsakwasighwa mna lipondo lya simba?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:12">Naye kedika kalonga, “Ona, apfo pfipfo pfaili. Alyo laghitso iliwalongotsa Wamedi na Waajemi, nalyo litsokala pfipfo.”<verse eid="DAN 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 6:13" />Nawo wamlongela mfalume, “Danyeli, yumwe wa awala iwahamile kulawa isi ya Yuda ng'okutegheletsa baye, wala ng'okinda baye lilaghitso lyawikile, naye kolomba mala ndatu kwa chila tsuwa.” <verse eid="DAN 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 6:14" />Mfalume hayahulike agho kaghanzika ng'ani mna ghumoyo ghwake, naye kabama yamkombole Danyeli, kefikitsa yatende choni ili yamkombole mbaka litsuwa lihonga. <verse eid="DAN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 6:15" />Baho iwanu awala wetingana na waghenda hamwe kwa mfalume Dario wamlongela, “Ghwe mfalume, umanye ka malaghitso ghoghose au imiko yoyose ya Wamedi na Waajemi ikwikighwa na mfalume kuduhu munu iyodaha kuighalusa.”<verse eid="DAN 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 6:16" />Baho mfalume Dario kalaghitsa wamghale Danyeli, nawo wamghala wamwasa mna lipondo lya simba. Mfalume kamlongela Danyeli, “Imulungu wako yumsang'anila matsuwa ghose katsokukombola.” <verse eid="DAN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 6:17" />Nawo wasola libwe walika mchanya mwa lipondo. Naye Mfalume keka muhuli ghwake imwenyegho, na mihuli ya iwakulu wake, ili haleke kuwa na munu wa ukumkombola Danyeli. <verse eid="DAN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 6:18" />Kuya mfalume kaghenda kuna ing'anda yake ya chifalume, ako kakala meso, ng'ajile baye wala kunwa chochose, wala ng'atendile ichihungo chochose baye. <verse eid="DAN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 6:19" />Nemitondotondo mfalume Dario katsuma kaghenda kuna lipondo lya simba. <verse eid="DAN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 6:20" />Hayapfikile habehi na lipondo kamkema Danyeli kwa usungu, “Danyeli, mtumighwa wa Imulungu iyali mgima! Pfihi Imulungu wako yumsang'anila matsuwa ghose kakukombola na iwasimba awano?” <verse eid="DAN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 6:21" />Danyeli kamwidika “Ghwe mfalume Imulungu yakwike ukale matsuwa ghose! <verse eid="DAN 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 6:22" />Imulungu wangu katuma malaika wake waidiwa imilomo ya simba, nawo ng'awandaghile baye, katenda apfo kwaapfila sitendile chochose chihile kuna yeye, wala kuna ghweghwe.” <verse eid="DAN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 6:23" />Bahala mfalume kadeng'elela ng'ani, kalaghitsa Danyeli yalapfighwe mna lipondo. Nawo wamlapfa, naye Danyeli ng'alaghike hata chidogho kwaapfila tsakehuwila Imulungu wake. <verse eid="DAN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 6:24" />Mfalume kalaghitsa iwanu awala iwampfughulile ghomba Danyeli waghoghighwe, nawo wasighwa mna lipondo lya simba hamwe na wapinga wawo na iwana wawo. Ng'ana wapfike hasi baye ha lipondo alila, simba wawatsahulatsahula na wabenabena imipate yawo.<verse eid="DAN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 6:25" />Baho mfalume Dario kawandikila iwanu wa kabila tsose, iwanu wa isi tsose, na iwanu wa lugha tsose,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 6:25">Mkale tseghamba! <verse eid="DAN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 6:26" />Nene nolaghitsa apfino, “Mna ufalume wangu iwanu wose wampfuke na wamtegheletse Imulungu wa Danyeli.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">Yeye yuyo Imulungu iyali na ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">kokala matsuwa ghose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">kuduhu munu iyodaha kuhinya ufalume wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:26">na utawala wake wokala matsuwa ghose.<verse eid="DAN 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 6:27" />Yeye kohonetsa na kokombola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">kotenda pfihulo na pfinu pfa kukangawatsa kulanga na muisi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DAN 6:27">Yeye kamkombola Danyeli hayang'ali yobama ukukomighwa na simba.”<verse eid="DAN 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 6:28" />Apfo Danyeli tsakakala kwa ukubweda mna ghamatsuwa ghayatawale mfalume Dario, na mfalume Koreshi wa Uajemi.<verse eid="DAN 6:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DAN 7" />
  <para style="s">Wanyama wane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 7:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kwanza mfalume Belishaza hayanzile kutawala ghumji ghwa Babeli, Danyeli hayawasile mwisatsi mwake kapata maono na kalota ndoto. Naye kaghandika aghala ghayonile mna indoto yake.<verse eid="DAN 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 7:2" />Mna ghamaono ghangu nechilo mbona libeho kulawa chila ubali lyoduma kwa ngupfu mna ibahali ng'ulu. <verse eid="DAN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 7:3" />Baho wanyama wakulu wane wakali walawa mna ibahali, chila yumwe ng'eghalile na miyaghe baye. <verse eid="DAN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 7:4" />Imnyama wa kwanza keghala na simba, tsakana mapamanilo ka magengele. Haning'ali nimlola mapamanilo ghake ghakusuka, naye kema kwa maghulu meli ka munu. Kuya keng'ighwa ghumoyo ghwa munu.<verse eid="DAN 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 7:5" />Imnyama wa keli keghala na imyama iyokemighwa dubu, ubali wake umwe tsawinuka, na mipate midatu ya tsimbapfu tsaikala mna ghamatsino ghake, wamlongela, “Lelo winuke uje inyama mbaka wighute.”<verse eid="DAN 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 7:6" />Kuya hambele hangu mbona mnyama yungi, naye keghala na chui, mna ghumghongo ghwake tsakana mapamanilo ka gha chideghe, imnyama ayo tsakana matwi mane, naye keng'ighwa tsingupfu tsa ukutawala.<verse eid="DAN 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 7:7" />Kuya mna indoto ayo nimwona mnyama wa kane, naye tsakana ngupfu ng'ani na ung'amlola kokughela wogha na kokutenda upfuke, ayo tsakana matsino makulu gha chuma, yang'ali yakuja na ukubenabena pfihande, na ipfijo ipfikalile yang'ali yopfibayughabayugha kwa maghulu ghake. Yeye ng'eghalile na awala wadatu baye, naye tsakana membe kumi. <verse eid="DAN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 7:8" />Haning'ali nilola tsimembe atso, niyona membe ingi ndodo ilawilila mna tsimembe atsila kumi, ili imembe ayo ipate hanu ha ukukala, membe ndatu tsing'olighwa, Imembe ayo tsaina nenge ka tsa munu, na mlomo ghwake ghung'ali ghulonga kwa maghodo.<verse eid="DAN 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ghamono gha imunu yokala matsuwa ghose</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 7:9" />Haning'ali nighendelela ukulola, mbona ipfighoda pfa ufalume pfikighwa hanu aho, na baho tsakakala mnzehe yumwe iyakali miyaka mingi ya ghumwande iyapfalile nguwo nzelu chwee, na tsimvili tsake tsa nzelu ka sufu, ichighoda chake tsa imilambi ya ghumoto, na mataili ghake ghose ghakala gha moto ighukwaka. <verse eid="DAN 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 7:10" />Hana ichighoda acho gulawila mto ghwa moto ghubita hambele hake. Iwanu maelufu kwa maelufu, wema hambele hake wamsang'anile. Kuya walamtsi watsa wakala hasi na wapfughula ipfitabu apfila ipfandikighwe aghala ghawang'ali wotendagha iwanu.<verse eid="DAN 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 7:11" />Kuya nighendelela ukulola kwaapfila imembe aila ing'ali ighendelela ukulonga tsimbuli tsa ukwighoda, nilola mbaka imnyama ayo kakomighwa na ilukuli lwake walwasa mna ghumoto aghula ghung'ali ghukwaka. <verse eid="DAN 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 7:12" />Wanyama awala wangi wabokighwa tsingupfu tsawo tsa ukutawala, lekeni wawo iwenyegho walekighwa wakale chidogho.<verse eid="DAN 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 7:13" />Mna tsindoto tsangu nechilo mbona chinu ka munu kakutsa hamwe na libingu komghendela Imnzehe ayula wa ghumwande. Na iwanu wamsola wamghala hambele hake. <verse eid="DAN 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 7:14" />Naye keng'ighwa ukulu, utunitso na ufalume ili iwanu wa makabila ghose, wa isi yose, na lugha tsose wamtumikile. Utawala wake wokala matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, na ufalume wake ng'autsomala baye.<verse eid="DAN 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pfagholonga ghamaono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 7:15" />Lelo nene Danyeli, ghamaono ghambonile ghanitsupfa na ghanitenda nighanzike ng'ani mna ghumoyo ghwangu. <verse eid="DAN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 7:16" />Apfo nimsoghelela yumwe wa awala malaika iwemile habehi nimghutsa mana ya aghano ghose. Naye kanongela mana ya ipfinu apfino. <verse eid="DAN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 7:17" />“Iwanyama awo wane iwakulu watsakuwa wafalume wane iwatsolawila muisi. <verse eid="DAN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 7:18" />Lekeni iwanu welile wa Imulungu iyali kuchanya watsakwing'ighwa ufalume, nawo watsolongotsa matsuwa ghose, ona matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa.”<verse eid="DAN 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 7:19" />Kuya nibama nimanye mana ya imnyama ayula wa kane yang'eghalile na wayaghe wose, na ung'amlola kopfuka, na ghamatsino ghake tsa gha chuma, na tsinumba tsake tsa shaba, imnyama iyajile na kubenabena pfihande na kubajughabajugha kwa ghamaghulu ghake ipfijo ipfikalile. <verse eid="DAN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 7:20" />Pfipfila nibama nimanye mana ya tsimembe atsila kumi itsikalile mwitwi mwake, na imembe aila ilawilile ahala tsimembe ndatu hatsing'olighwe, imembe ikalile na tsinenge na mlomo ghwake ghulongile mbuli tsa ukwighoda na iyoneke ina ngupfu kubita membe tsingi.<verse eid="DAN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 7:21" />Haning'ali nighendelela ukulola, niyona imembe ayo ing'ali iwatowa iwanu wa Imulungu, nayo iwahuma. <verse eid="DAN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 7:22" />Kuya imnzehe wa ghumwande ayula katsa kaweng'a ihaki iwanu iwelile wa Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani, na ghamatsuwa haghapfikile, iwanu welile wa Imulungu weng'ighwa ufalume.<verse eid="DAN 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 7:23" />Naye kanongela apfino, “Imnyama ayula wa kane utsakuwa ufalume wa kane utsolawilila muisi, nawo ng'autseghala na falume tsingi baye, na utsoihinya isi yose, kuibajughabajugha na kuibenabena pfihandehande. <verse eid="DAN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 7:24" />Tsimembe atsila kumi watsakuwa wafalume kumi iwatsolawa mna ufalume auno. Wang'alawa awo, katsolawila mfalume yungi, yeye ng'atseghala na awala iwalongole ukutawala, naye katsowaghwisa wafalume wadatu. <verse eid="DAN 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 7:25" />Yeye katsomlonga pfihile Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani na katsowadununza iwanu wake iwelile, na katsoghalusa ipfipindi na malaghitso ghawo, na katsowatawa iwanu wa Imulungu miyaka midatu na miyetsi sita. <verse eid="DAN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 7:26" />Lekeni libalatsa litsomuhigha na katsobokighwa ukulu wake, na ufalume wake utsomala ghendo. <verse eid="DAN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 7:27" />Baho ufalume, utawala na ukulu wa tsifalume tsose tsili muisi watsakwing'ighwa iwanu iwelile wa Imulungu iyali kuchanya ng'ani. Ufalume wawo utsakuwa wa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, na watawala wose watsomtumikila na kumtegheletsa yeye.”<verse eid="DAN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 7:28" />Lelo imbuli aila itsighila ahano, nene Danyeli nidununzika ng'ani haning'ali nikwalangula mwitwi mwangu mbaka ichihanga changu chighaluka. Lekeni imbuli ayo tsaniika mna ghumoyo ghwangu, siisemwile baye.<verse eid="DAN 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DAN 8" />
  <para style="s">Ghamaono gha ing'olo mmale na mene mmale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 8:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu ghwa utawala wa mfalume Belishaza nene Danyeli nipata maono ghangi. <verse eid="DAN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 8:2" />Mna ghamaono agho, nibona ka na mna ghumji ghwa Susa ghutsungulusighwe ubanda, ghumji mkulu ghuli mna ghumkowa ghwa Elamu, nyima hambalimbali ha ghumto ghwa Ulai. <verse eid="DAN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 8:3" />Hanyinule tsinenge, mbona ng'olo mmale yana tsimembe mbili tsing'ulu kema habehi na ghumto aghwo, na membe imwe tsa ng'ulu ng'ani kubita imembe ingi, na hambele ighendelela ukukula. <verse eid="DAN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 8:4" />Nimwona ing'olo ayo mmale kokunughitsa chila chinu ichikalile ubali wa maghalibi, kasikazini, na kusini, wala kuduhu mnyama wowose yadahile kwima hambele hake, wala iyadahile ukuhepa tsingupfu tsake, naye ketenda mkulu ka pfabamile mwenyegho. <verse eid="DAN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 8:5" />Haning'ali nifikitsa imbuli aino, baho nimwona ng'unzu kana membe imwe ng'ulu ng'ani ikalile haghatighati ha tsinenge tsake kakutsa kulawa maghalibi, kadaluka kwa ngupfu bila kudonza hasi. <verse eid="DAN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 8:6" />Naye kamghendela imvulati ayula yana tsimembe mbili yanimwonile kema habehi na ghumto, kampfamila kwa ngupfu tsake tsose. <verse eid="DAN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 8:7" />Naye kamsoghelela ing'olo mmale ayula aku kamghudubukila, apfo kampfamila kwa ngupfu na katsibenabena tsimembe tsake mbili. Ing'olo mmale ayula ng'adahile baye ukumuhuma, apfo kamghwisa hasi imvulati ayula na kambajughabajugha, wala kuduhu iyadahile kumkombola na tsingupfu tsake. <verse eid="DAN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 8:8" />Baho imene mmale ketutumla ng'ani, lekeni tsingupfu tsake hatsimalile, imembe yake ing'ulu ibeneka. Hanu hake tsota membe tsingi nne itsoneke mwatsimwatsi itsilolile chila ubali kulanga. <verse eid="DAN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 8:9" />Kulawa mna imwe ya atsila tsimembe nne, ilawila membe ingi ndodo, ikula ng'ani ilola ubali wa kusini, mashariki na ilolesa isi aila inoghile ng'ani. <verse eid="DAN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 8:10" />Imembe ayo ikula ng'ani mbaka tsingupfu tsake tsipfika kuna likingili lya ipfiumbe pfa kulanga, lilaghatsa hasi ipfiumbe wangi wa likingili alila, na tsinondo tsingi, na kutsibajughabajugha. <verse eid="DAN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 8:11" />Imembe ayo ibona iyenyegho ng'ulu kubita imkulu wa pfiumbe wa kulanga. Na ileghusa tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa itsing'ali tsilapfighwa kuna yeye chila tsuwa, na hanu hake helile haghwisighwa hasi. <verse eid="DAN 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 8:12" />Iwanu watenda nzambi, waleka kumlapfila Imulungu tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsa chila litsuwa, lekeni wawo wailapfila imembe aila, na iwatenda iwanu iwotoghola ukweli waleke ukuutoghola. Imembe ayo idaha kutenda chila chinu ka pfaibamile. <verse eid="DAN 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 8:13" />Kuya nihulika malaika yumwe komghutsa malaika miyaghe kalonga, “Aghala ighalongighwe na ghamaono aghano ghatsoghendelela mbaka tsuwachi? Tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsa chila tsuwa tsitsohinyighwa mbaka tsuwachi? Mbaka tsuwachi imembe ayo ndodo itsakuwa ngupfu mna hanu helile na kuwabajugha bajugha iwanu wa Imulungu?” <verse eid="DAN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 8:14" />Miyaghe kamwidika, “Pfitsoghendelela kwa matsuwa elufu mbili na miya ndatu nemihe na nemitondo, na hambele Imulungu katsotenda ing'anda ya Imulungu yele keli.”<verse eid="DAN 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaika Gablieli kolonga mana ya ghamaono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 8:15" />Nene Danyeli hambonile ghamaono agho, na haning'ali nibama kumanya mana yake, baho mbona chinu ka munu chima hambele hangu. <verse eid="DAN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 8:16" />Kuya nihulika imunu kokema kulawa kuna ghumto ghwa Ulai, “Gabulieli, mlongele imunu ayuno mana ya ghamaono aghano.” <verse eid="DAN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 8:17" />Gablieli kanisoghelela ahala hanyimile, nene nipfuka ng'ani mbaka nighwa hasi. Lekeni kanilongela, “Ghwe munu umanye ka ghamaono ghawonile gholonga iimbulu ya ukutsigha kwa ghamatsuwa.” <verse eid="DAN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 8:18" />Hayang'ali yolonga na nene, nighwa hasi na niwasa fofofo. Lekeni yeye kanikinda, kanyinula na nene nyima kwa maghulu ghangu. <verse eid="DAN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 8:19" />Naye kanongela, “Tegheletsa, nitsokulongela ighatsolawila hambele mna ghamatsuwa gha ukutsigha, aho Imulungu hayatsoghudubuka, ghamaono gholangusa ka agho ghatsolawila mna ghamatsuwa gha ukutsigha ighekighwe na Imulungu.<verse eid="DAN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 8:20" />“Ing'olo mmale ayula yana tsimembe mbili yumwonile, awo wawo wafalume wa Umedi na Uajemi. <verse eid="DAN 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 8:21" />Imene mmale ayula yana imighala mingi, ayo yuyo mfalume wa Uyunani. Na imembe aila ing'ulu ili haghatighati ha tsinenge tsake, ayo yuyo mfalume wake iyakwandusa ukutawala. <verse eid="DAN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 8:22" />Imembe aila ibeneke kuya membe tsingi nne tsote hanu hake, mana yake ufalume umwe utseghola uwe falume nne, lekeni tsifalume atso ng'atsitsakuwa na ngupfu baye kubita ufalume aula wa mwanduso.<verse eid="DAN 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 8:23" />“Iwafalume awo hawatsomalitsa ukutawala, na iighehile haghatsakongetseka, mfalume yumwe iyali mkali, msughu, na iyali na ichidandali katsolawila. <verse eid="DAN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 8:24" />Katsakuwa na ngupfu ng'ani, lekeni tsingupfu atso ng'atsitsolawa kuna yeye imwenyegho baye, na yeye katsohinya pfihile ghendo, na katsobweda na kutenda chochose chayobama. Katsowakoma iwanu wana tsingupfu, na iwanu iwelile wa Imulungu. <verse eid="DAN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 8:25" />Kwaapfila kakengela katsotenda aghala ghayobama ukutenda, na katsetunya mna ghumoyo ghwake, na iwanu iwakalile tseghamba katsowakoma kwa ukwidikitsa, naye katsetowa na ayula iyali Mkulu wa iwakulu, lekeni katsokomighwa bila tsingupfu tsa imunu. <verse eid="DAN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 8:26" />Ghamaono agho gha tsinambiko tsa nemihe na nemitondo ghaulangusighwe, agho gha kweli, ila ghweghwe ugheke mmoyo, kwaapfila ghatsobita matsuwa mengi mbaka haghatsolawila.” <verse eid="DAN 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 8:27" />Ghamaono agho haghamalile, nene Danyeli nitsilika na niwa mtamu kwa matsuwa chidogho. Hanibwighinduke nighendelela kusang'ana tsing'onde tsa mfalume, lekeni ghamaono aghala ghanikangawatsa, na nene simanyile mana yake choni.<verse eid="DAN 8:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DAN 9" />
  <para style="s">Danyeli kowalombela iwanu wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 9:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa mwanduso ghwa Dario imwana wa Ahasuero yalawile mna ilukolo lwa Wamedi hayanduse kuwa mtawala mna ufalume wa Wakalidayo, <verse eid="DAN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 9:2" />nene Danyeli ning'ali nisoma ipfitabu ipfilonga mbuli tsa Imulungu, na mumo niimanya imbuli aila ya imiyaka sabini IMNDEWA iyamlongele nabii Yeremia ya ukukala mahame kwa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu. <verse eid="DAN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 9:3" />Apfo nihunduka nimlomba IMNDEWA Imulungu, nifunga ukuja na kupfala maghunila na kwibakatsa lipfu. <verse eid="DAN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 9:4" />Nimlomba IMNDEWA, Imulungu wangu, na kumlongela tsinzambi tsangu na tsa iwanu wangu, “Ghwe Imulungu mkulu na wa ukupfukighwa, ghweghwe kotimitsa laghano na kowatendela uluso awala iwokukunda na iwokinda malaghitso ghako, <verse eid="DAN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 9:5" />twetwe tutenda nzambi, na tutotsa, tutenda ighehile na tuleka kukutoghola ghweghwe, tukulema ghweghwe, na ng'atuwinzile baye ghamalaghitso ghako na imiko yako, <verse eid="DAN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 9:6" />wala ng'atuwategheletse baye iwatumighwa wako manabii, wawo walonga usenga wako na wafalume wetu, iwakulu wetu, aba tsetu na iwanu wose wa isi. <verse eid="DAN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 9:7" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, matsuwa ghose ghweghwe kotenda ighali gha haki, lekeni leloli twetwe twakona chinyala kwaapfila ng'atukotoghole ghweghwe baye, na kwaapfila tukutendela ghehile, twetwe iwanu wa Yuda, iwanu itukala Yerusalemu, na Waisiraeli wose yauwapwililse kuna isi itsili habehi na itsili kutali kwa ghamatotso ghawo ghawakutendele. <verse eid="DAN 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 9:8" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, twetwe, na wafalume wetu, iwakulu wetu na aba tsetu twakona chinyala kwaapfila tukutendela nzambi. <verse eid="DAN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 9:9" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, hata ka twetwe tutenda nzambi, lekeni ghweghwe kotwonela libatsi na kotuleghusila tsinzambi. <verse eid="DAN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 9:10" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, twetwe tulema kukutegheletsa ghweghwe na ng'atukindile baye ghamalaghitso ghako ghautwing'ile kubitila iwatumighwa wako manabii. <verse eid="DAN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 9:11" />Waisiraeli wose ng'awakindile baye malaghitso ghako, walema kutegheletsa achila chaulongile, lelo kwaapfila tukutendela nzambi, malighito ighandikighwe mna ghamalaghitso gha imtumighwa wako Musa ghose ghatupfikila twetwe. <verse eid="DAN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 9:12" />Apfo ghweghwe kughatenda aghala ghaulongile kutsotutendela twetwe hamwe na iwatawala wetu. Naghwe kutughalila majanga makulu mna ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu kubita imiji yose ili muisi. <verse eid="DAN 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 9:13" />Kututowa ka pfayandikighwe mna malaghitso gha Musa, lekeni mbaka sambi ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu, ng'atukulombile baye utwonele libatsi ili tutsileke tsambi tsetu, na tutende aghala ighotogholeka. <verse eid="DAN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 9:14" />Apfo Ghwe IMNDEWA Imulungu wetu tsakubama kutuhigha, na kutenda ka pfubamile kwaapfila matsuwa ghose kotenda ighali gha haki natwe ng'atukutegheletse ghweghwe baye.<verse eid="DAN 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 9:15" />“Ghwe IMNDEWA, Imulungu wetu, kuwalapfa iwanu wako kuna isi ya Misiri, na kwa tsingupfu tsako kwitenda mkulu mbaka sambi, lelo twolonga, tutenda nzambi, na tutenda ghehile. <verse eid="DAN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 9:16" />Ghwe IMNDEWA, kwaapfila ghweghwe kotenda ighali gha haki, uleke kughonela maya au kughudubukila ghumji ghwako ghwa Yerusalemu, chidunda chako ichelile. Iwanu wose wa tsiisi itsili habehi na iwanu wako waghubetsa ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu kwaajili ya tsinzambi tsetu na ighehile ghawatendile iwahenga wetu. <verse eid="DAN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 9:17" />Lelo, ghwe Imulungu wetu, utegheletse ghanikulomba na ghanikudedetsa nene mtumighwa wako, kwaapfila ghweghwe kuna libatsi, kwaajili yako ghwe IMNDEWA, uitsenge keli ing'anda yako ihinyike. <verse eid="DAN 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 9:18" />Ghwe Imulungu wetu uwambe lighutwi uhulike, ufumbule tsinenge ulole ghumji aghula ghwaughusaghule, ukulomba kwatulomba si ka twetwe tutenda ighokunoghela, ila kwaapfila ghweghwe kotwonela libatsi ng'ani. <verse eid="DAN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 9:19" />Ghwe IMNDEWA utuhulike na utuleghusile nzambi tsetu. Ghwe IMNDEWA, utegheletse na uleke kukawa ukutenda kwaapfila ghumji aghuno na iwanu awano wa kwako ghweghwe ghumwenyegho.”<verse eid="DAN 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaika Gablieli kofasili unabii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 9:20" />Lelo, haning'ali nilonga na ukumlomba Imulungu yanileghusile tsnzambi tsangu na tsinzambi tsa iwanu wangu wa Isiraeli na ukumlomba kwaajili ya ichidunda chake ichelile, <verse eid="DAN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 9:21" />Gabulieli, imalaika ayula yanimwonile mna ghamaono aho mwanduso, kahulumka himahima mbaka hanu ahala hanikalile, nacho tsachikala chipindi cha ukulapfa inambiko ya nemihe. <verse eid="DAN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 9:22" />Naye kanilongela, “Ghwe Danyeli, nitsa nikwing'e ihekima na nikutende udahe ukumanya ipfinu apfino. <verse eid="DAN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 9:23" />Haung'ali ulomba, Imulungu kakwidika, na nene nitsa nikulongele kwaapfila kokukunda ng'ani. Lelo ufikitse ghoya na ughamanye ghamaono aghano.<verse eid="DAN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 9:24" />“Imulungu kalaghitsa chipindi cha majuma sabini kwa iwanu wako, na kwa ghumji ghwako ighwelile, gha ukumalitsa ghamatotso, na ukuleka ukutenda tsinzambi, uwaleghusile ghehile ghawatendile, na uwetendele ighali haki, na ugheke muhuli ghamaono, na uhabake mapfuta ihanu ihelile ng'ani. <verse eid="DAN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 9:25" />Lelo umanye na utange mbuli aino, kulawa haghatsolapfighwa ghamalaghitso gha ukutsenga keli ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu mbaka hayatsakutsa imunu iyasaghulighwe na Imulungu yatawale, itsakuwa chipindi cha majuma saba. Na ghumji ghwa Yerusalemu ghutsotsengighwa keli kwa majuma sitini na meli, nagho ghutsakuwa na nzila ng'ulu na mahandaki, lekeni ichipindi acho chitsakuwa na maghayo. <verse eid="DAN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 9:26" />Na ghamajuma agho sitini na meli haghotsomala, ichilongotsi ayula iyasaghulighwe na Imulungu katsokomighwa na ng'atsokala na chinu baye. Iwanu wa imkulu iyatsakutsa watsoghuhinya ghumji na hanu helile ghendo kwa ngupfu nyingi ka tsa ghamatsi ighamememile pfaghokulusa ipfinu, na iwanu watsoghendelela ukwitowa ka Imulungu pfayalaghitse. <verse eid="DAN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 9:27" />Imtawala ayo katsakwika laghano na iwanu wengi kwa miyaka saba. Na ing'abita miyaka madatu na nusu katsoghoma tsinambiko na ipfinu ipfilapfigwa. Kuya hanu hake helile ihenulighwe hatsakwima chinu ichidesa na ichihinya, na hatsokala pfipfo mbaka ayula iyachimise yakomighwe ka Imulungu pfayalaghitse.”<verse eid="DAN 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DAN 10" />
  <para style="s">Ghamaono gha Danyeli mna ghumto Tigili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 10:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kadatu ghwa mfalume Koreshi wa Uajemi, Danyeli iyakemighwe Beliteshaza tsakaghubulighwa maono. Ghamaono agho tsaghakala gha kweli, lekeni makomu ukumanyika. Hata apfo yeye kamanya ghamaona agho kwaapfila tsakeng'ighwa ukumanya ghamaono. <verse eid="DAN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 10:2" />Chipindi acho nene Danyeli ning'ali nidomboketsa kwa majuma madatu. <verse eid="DAN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 10:3" />Na chipindi chose cha majuma madatu, sijile chinu chinoghile wala inyama, sinwele dipfai, wala sibakile ghamapfuta baye mlukuli lwangu. <verse eid="DAN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 10:4" />Na mna litsuwa lya ishilini na nne, nene tsanyima mmbalimbali mwa ghumto Tigiri. <verse eid="DAN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 10:5" />Tsanyinula tsinenge tsangu ndola, nimwona munu kapfala magwanda matselu na mchuno koha msipi ghwa nzahabu ighulawile Ufazi. <verse eid="DAN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 10:6" />Lukuli lwake tsalukala ka zabalajadi, na chihanga chake ka umeme, na nenge tsake ka milambi ya ghumoto. Ghamaghulu ghake na ghamoko ghake tsaghang'aika ka ishaba ikuwighwe ng'ani. Na litsi lyake tsalihulikika ka litsi lya wanu wengi. <verse eid="DAN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 10:7" />Nene Danyeli niliyeka yuyo yambonile ghamaono agho. Iwanu awala iwakalile hamwe na nene ng'awonile baye ghamaono agho, lekeni tsawapfuka ng'ani, watsuma waghenda kwipfisa. <verse eid="DAN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 10:8" />Apfo wanileka niliyeka nolola ghamaono agho. Ichihanga changu chighaluka mbaka kuduhu munu iyanitangile, na nikala nahela ngupfu. <verse eid="DAN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 10:9" />Hanihulike litsi lyake nighwa hasi na tsinongo nito tsinitsila. <verse eid="DAN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 10:10" />Baho ghumoko ghunikinda ghunyinula na kuning'a ngupfu ghamaghulu na ghamoko ghangu.<verse eid="DAN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 10:11" />Malaika kanilongela, “Ghwe Danyeli, yukundighwa ng'ani, wime utegheletse ghanikulongela, kwaapfila nitumighwa kuna ghweghwe.” Hayang'ali yonilongela agho nyima aku noghudema.<verse eid="DAN 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 10:12" />Kuya kanilongela, “Danyeli uleke ukupfuka, Imulungu wako kahulika ghaung'ali ulomba kulawa litsuwa alila lya mwanduso ahala hawihulumse hambele hake ili umanye. Na nene nitsa kwaajili ya aghala ghaulombile. <verse eid="DAN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 10:13" />Lekeni imkulu wa ufalume wa Uajemi ng'anilekile nibite baye kwa matsuwa ishilini na moja. Lekeni Mikaeli, yumwe wa iwakulu, katsa kunyapfila. Apfo nimleka ako ketowa na imkulu wa ufalume wa Uajemi, <verse eid="DAN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 10:14" />na nene nitsa nikulongele ighatsowapata iwanu wako mna ghamatsuwa ighakutsa kwaapfila ghamaono ghawonile gha chipindi ichikutsa.”<verse eid="DAN 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 10:15" />Hayang'ali yolonga agho, nene ninamila hasi sidahile ukulonga baye kwaapfila ning'ali nipfuka ng'ani. <verse eid="DAN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 10:16" />Kuya yumwe iyakalile ka munu kadonza milomo yangu, na baho nimlongela ayula yemile habehi na nene, “Mndewa wangu, ghamaono aghano ghanitenda nighanzike na nikeng'eneke. <verse eid="DAN 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 10:17" />Nene mtumwa wako nidahatse ukulonga naghwe? Nene nahela ghendo tsingupfu mbaka sidaha ukuhumula baye.”<verse eid="DAN 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 10:18" />Kuya ayula yakalile ka imunu kanidonza keli kanighuma ngupfu. <verse eid="DAN 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 10:19" />Naye kanilongela, “Uleke ukupfuka ghweghwe yukundighwa ng'ani, ukale tseghamba na uwe na tsingupfu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 10:19">Hayalongile na nene nipata ngupfu keli nilonga, Nilongele achila chubama ukulonga. <verse eid="DAN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 10:20" />Naye kanilongela, “Apfi komanya heule nitsile? Lelo nitsakuya ili niketowe na mkulu wa Uajemi, mfalume wa Uyunani katsolawila. <verse eid="DAN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 10:21" />Lekeni nitsokulongela aghala ighandikighwe mna chitabu cha ukweli. Kuduhu imunu yatsonyapfila ila mkulu wenu Mikaeli.<verse eid="DAN 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DAN 11" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 11:1" />Mna ghumwaka ghwa kwanza ghwa utawala wa mfalume Dario wa Umedi nene nyima nimwapfile na nimghume ngupfu. <verse eid="DAN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 11:2" />Lelo nitsokulongela ukweli wa tsimbuli atsino.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="DAN 11:2">Ufalume wa Misiri na ufalume wa Siria</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DAN 11:2">Lola wafalume wangi wadatu wa isi ya Uajemi watsolawila. Na mfalume wa kane katsakuwa tajili kubita awo wose. Na hayatsakongetseka tsingupfu kubitila utajiri wake, katsakwandusa ukusongeletsa ufalume wa Uyunani utowighwe. <verse eid="DAN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 11:3" />Kuya katsolawila mfalume yana tsingupfu iyatsotawala kwa ngupfu na ukutenda chayobama. <verse eid="DAN 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 11:4" />Tsingupfu tsake hatsitsomala, ufalume wake utsobeneka na kwighola mala nne. Iwanu wa lukolo lwake ng'awatsotawala baye, wala ufalume wake ng'autsoghendelela baye, ila utsosolighwa na iwanu wangi. <verse eid="DAN 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 11:5" />Mfalume wa Misiri katsakuwa na ngupfu, na yumwe wa iwakulu wake katsakuwa na ngupfu kubita yeye, na utawala wake utsakuwa mkulu ng'ani. <verse eid="DAN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 11:6" />Miyaka midodo haitsomala, watselunga kwaapfila neghe wa mfalume wa Misri katsokwelighwa na iwanu wa ikaye ya mfalume wa Siriya, lekeni ng'atsoghendelela kuwa na ngupfu baye, pfipfila mfalume na iwanu wake ng'awotsodudumila baye na ipinga ayo, iwanaghe na iwatumighwa iyaghendile nawo wose watsokomighwa. <verse eid="DAN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 11:7" />Hambele yumwe wa lukolo wa neghe ayo katsakuwa mfalume. Katsowapfamila maasikali wa mfalume wa kasikazini na kwingila mna ngome tsawo na kuwahuma. <verse eid="DAN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 11:8" />Naye katsopfighala ipfinyagho pfa kulubula pfa imilungu yawo mbaka kuna isi ya Misiri, kwa miyaka midodo mfalume wa kusini ng'atsompfamila mfalume wa Siria. <verse eid="DAN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 11:9" />Lekeni hambele mfalume ayuno wa Siria katsoupfamila mndewa wa kusini ila katsakuyitsighwa yoye kuna isi yake. <verse eid="DAN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 11:10" />Na iwana wa mfalume wa Siriya watsoweka hamwe maasikali wengi na ili wetowe. Maasikali awo watsakuwa wengi nawo watsobita haghatighati na kuitowa ingome yake. <verse eid="DAN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 11:11" />Mfalume wa Misiri katsoghenda yaketowe na mfalume wa Siriya aku kaghudubuka. Imfalume ayo wa Siria katsakuwa na maasikali wengi, lekeni ng'atsohuma baye. <verse eid="DAN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 11:12" />Mfalume wa Misiri hayatsowakoma maasikali wengi wa mfalume wa Siriya, katseghoda ng'ani, lekeni ng'atsoghendelela ukuhuma baye. <verse eid="DAN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 11:13" />Kwaapfila mfalume wa Siriya katsakuwa na maasikali wengi kubita awala wa mwanduso, na miyaka midodo haitsomala, katsakuya na maasikali wengi wana tsisilaha nyingi tsa ukwitowela na mali nyingi. <verse eid="DAN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DAN 11:14" />Na mna matsuwa agho iwanu wengi watsomlema mfalume wa Misiri, wamwenga wa iwanu wana ichidandali wa isi yako watsoghaluka ili watimitse ghamaono, lekeni ng'awatsodaha baye. <verse eid="DAN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DAN 11:15" />Baho mfalume wa Siriya katsakutsa yaghutsingile na yaghutowe ghumji ghuna tsingome. Maasikali wa Misiri, ng'awatsodaha baye ukuwaghoma, hata maasikali wawo iwadahile ukwitowa kubita maasikali wangi ng'awatsakuwa na ngupfu baye ya ukwitowa nawo. <verse eid="DAN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DAN 11:16" />Mfalume wa Siria iyakutsa kutsingila isi yaitowe, ayo katsotenda ka pfayobama, na kuduhu munu iyodaha kwima hambele hake. Yeye katsakwima mna isi inoghile, na isi ayo katsoihinya. <verse eid="DAN 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DAN 11:17" />Imfalume ayo katsobama yatse na maasikali wake wose, naye katsakwika laghano na mfalume na Misiri lya ukumlapfa imwanaghe yakwelighwe na yeye ili yaukome ufalume wa maaduwi tsake, lekeni agho ng'aghatsotimila baye, wala ng'aghatsomwapfila chinu. <verse eid="DAN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DAN 11:18" />Hambele katsohunduka yaghende yakatsitowe tsiisi itsili kumwani, lekeni asikali mkulu yumwe katsochimalitsa ichinyala chake chayaghalile, na ichinyala acho chitsomuyila yeye imwenyegho. <verse eid="DAN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DAN 11:19" />Baho mfalume katsohunduka yoye kuna tsingome tsa isi yake mwenyegho, lekeni katsotowighwa na katsokomighwa. <verse eid="DAN 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DAN 11:20" />Kuya katsakutsa mfalume yungi iyatsotawala, ayo katsomtuma msola kodi kwaajil ya ihatsina ya ufalume wake. Na matsuwa chidogho hambele, imfalume ayo katsokomighwa lekeni si kwa imaya ya iwanu baye, wala si kwa ing'ondo.<verse eid="DAN 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mfalume yehile wa Siriya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DAN 11:21" />Malaika kaghendelela ukulonga, “Mfalume wa Siriya iyatsakutsa hambele katsobetsighwa na iwanu, yeye ng'atsobamighwa baye yatawale, iwanu hawotsokala tulu, yeye katsakutsa kwa ukwidukitsa na kuuboka ufalume. <verse eid="DAN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DAN 11:22" />Naye katsowakoma na kauwasa kutali maasikali wowose wana tsingupfu iwatsompinga, hata imkulu wa ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="DAN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DAN 11:23" />Katsakwika laghano na iwakulu wa isi tsingi, lekeni katsowaghutsukila, katsakongetseka igupfu hata ka katsotawala wanu chidogho. <verse eid="DAN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DAN 11:24" />Na kwa ukwidukitsa katsotsingila imikowa ina tsimali nyingi na katsotenda aghala ng'ana ghatendeke na sekulu tsake, wala yumwe wa iwahenga wake iwalongole. Katsowagholela iwanu wake ipfinu na tsimali tsayabokile kung'ondo. Na katsobama kuitowa imiji itsungulusighwe na ubanda, lekeni ng'atsotenda apfo baye kwa matsuwa mengi.<verse eid="DAN 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DAN 11:25" />“Kwa tsingupfu tsake katsakwika maasikali wengi ili yamtowe mfalume wa Misri, naye mfalume ayo wa Misiri pfipfila katsetowa naye aku kana maasikali wengi wana tsingupfu ng'ani, lekeni mfalume wa Misiri katsotowighwa kwaapfila kaghutsukighwa. <verse eid="DAN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DAN 11:26" />Awala iwashauli wake wawo iwatsomkoma hamwe na maasikali wake wana tsingupfu. <verse eid="DAN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DAN 11:27" />Kuya wafalume awo weli watsokala mmetsa na watsakuja hamwe, aku chila yumwe komfikitsa miyaghe pfihile na weghutsukila wawo kwa wawo, alyo ng'awatsolitenda baye, kwaapfila chipindi chikighwe ng'ana chipfike baye. <verse eid="DAN 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DAN 11:28" />Na mfalume wa Siriya katsakuya kuna isi yake aku kana tsimali nyingi tsayabokile kung'ondo, lekeni hayatsobita mnzila katsowatowa iwanu wa lilaghano lyelile. Naye katsotenda ka pfayobama, kuya katsakuya kuna isi yake.<verse eid="DAN 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DAN 11:29" />“Mna ghamatsuwa ghayekile Imulungu, mfalume wa Siria katsoitsingila keli isi ya Misiri, lekeni matsuwa aghano ng'aitsakuwa ka aho mwanduso baye. <verse eid="DAN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DAN 11:30" />Maasikali wa tsimeli tsa isi ya Kitimu, kwa taghwa lingi Urumi, tsitsakutsa ukwitowa naye, naye katsopfuka, katsohunduka yawalihinye iwanu iwolikinda lilaghano lyelile, na baho katsakuya yawahulikitse awala iwalekile kulikinda lilaghano ilyelile. <verse eid="DAN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DAN 11:31" />Maasikali wake wana tsilaha watsoitenda ing'anda ya Imulungu ihe, na watsotenda nambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsa chila litsuwa tsileke ukughendelela, na kalapfa ipfinu pfihile mna ing'anda iyelile. <verse eid="DAN 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DAN 11:32" />Na awala ing'awokinda lilaghano katsowaghitsa kwa ukuwaghutsukila, lekeni iwanu iwammanyile Imulungu wawo watsakwima ghoya na ng'awatsomtogholela baye. <verse eid="DAN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DAN 11:33" />Iwanu wako wana ihekima watsolangulitsa wanu wengi, hata apfo nawo watsokomighwa kwa lipanga, na kwa ghumoto, watsoghoghighwa na kwohighwa, na watsobokighwa tsimali tsawo kwa matsuwa mengi. <verse eid="DAN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DAN 11:34" />Hawatsodununzika iwanu watsowapfila chidogho, na iwanu ing'awotogholeka watselunga nawo. <verse eid="DAN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DAN 11:35" />Na iwanu wamwenga wana ihekima watsokomighwa ili yawadeghetetse iwakalile wagima, na yawahopfughe, na yawatende wele, mbaka hachitsopfika ichipindi ichikighwe na Imulungu.<verse eid="DAN 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DAN 11:36" />“Naye mfalume katsotenda ka pfayobama, katseghoda na katsebona ka yeye ka mkulu kubita milungu yose, na katsomlonga pfihile Imulungu iyali mkulu kubita milungu yose. Na katsoghendelela ukutenda apfino mbaka Imulungu hayatsomhigha, kwaapfila ighapangighwe ghobamighwa ghatimile. <verse eid="DAN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DAN 11:37" />Mfalume ayo katsoibetsa imilungu ya iwahenga wake, pfipfila katsombetsa imlungu ayula iyokundighwa ng'ani na wapinga, wala ng'atsomtegheletsa baye mlungu wowose, kwaapfila katsebona yeye mkulu kubita wose. <verse eid="DAN 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DAN 11:38" />Lekeni yeye katsomtegheletsa mlungu wa ingome, imulungu yang'atogholighwe baye na iwahenga wake, katsomlapfila nambiko tsa nzahabu, fetsa, mabwe gha bei ng'ulu, na nzawadi tsinoghile. <verse eid="DAN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DAN 11:39" />Naye katsoikinga ingome yake kwa ukwapfilighwa na mlungu mgheni, na katsowaheshimu ng'ani awala iwatsomtoghola yeye, na katsowatenda wawatawale wanu wengi, na katsowagholela isi kwa kubokela hongo.<verse eid="DAN 11:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DAN 11:40" />“Mna ghamatsuwa gha ukutsigha mfalume wa Misiri katsetowa, na mfalume wa Siriya, na imfalume ayo wa Siriya katsoetowa naye kwa ngupfu ka chipfulapfumbi, hamwe na mituka ya falasi, na wadina falasi, na tsimeli nyingi, naye katsobita kwa ngupfu mna isi nyingi ka ghamatsi ighamemile. <verse eid="DAN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DAN 11:41" />Pfipfila katsoipfamila isi iyelile, na katsokoma wanu wa isi nyingi, lekeni tsiisi atsino Edomu, Moabu na pfilongotsi wa Amoni watsokomboka kulawa mmoko mwake. <verse eid="DAN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DAN 11:42" />Naye haytsotsipfamila isi atso, na isi ya Misiri ng'aitsokomboka baye. <verse eid="DAN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DAN 11:43" />Katsotsitawala tsihatsina tsa nzahabu, fetsa na pfinu pfose pfa Misiri pfa bei ng'ulu. Na iwanu wa Libiya na Esiopia watsomuwinza yeye. <verse eid="DAN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DAN 11:44" />Lekeni tsimbuli itsitsolawa ubali mashaliki na kasikazini tsitsomwidusa, naye katsolawala aku kaghudubuka ili yawase kutali na kuwakoma iwanu wengi. <verse eid="DAN 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DAN 11:45" />Naye katsotsenga mahema ghake gha chifalume haghati ha ibahali na ichidunda ichelile, naye katsakufa na kuduhu munu iyatsomwapfila.”<verse eid="DAN 11:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DAN 12" />
  <para style="s">Ghamatsuwa gha ukutsigha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DAN 12:1" />Mna ghamatsuwa agho, malaika mkulu Mikaeli iyowalolesa ghoya iwanu wako katsolawila. Nawo iwanu watsoghaya ng'ani kubita matsuwa ghose ighapfosile, ahala iwanu hawanzile ukukala muisi. Lekeni mna ghamatsuwa agho chila yumwe iyandikighwe taghwa lyake mna ichitabu cha ugima katsokombolighwa. <verse eid="DAN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DAN 12:2" />Iwanu wengi iwafile watsotsilihuka, wamwenga watsakuwa na ugima wa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa, na wamwenga watsopata chinyala na watsobetsighwa matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="DAN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DAN 12:3" />Awala wana ihekima watsong'ala ka pfaling'ala lilanga, na awala iwowalongotsa iwanu wengi ukutenda ihaki, watsong'ala ka tsinondo matsuwa ghose ing'aghohupa. <verse eid="DAN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DAN 12:4" />Lekeni ghweghwe Danyeli ugheke mmoyo ghamalonga aghano, na uchike muhuli ichitabu mbaka ghamatsuwa gha ukutsigha ghapfike. Na iwanu wamwenga watsotsuma akuno na akuno ili wamanye ighatsolawila. <verse eid="DAN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DAN 12:5" />Kuya nene Danyeli tsandola, niwaona wanu wangi weli wema mmbalimbali mwa ghumto, yumwenga kema ubali auno, na yungi kema ubali ungi. <verse eid="DAN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DAN 12:6" />Munu yumwe kamghutsa imunu ayula iyapfalile tsinguwo tsinzelu iyemile mchanya mwa ghumto, “Angu ipfinu apfino pfa ukukangawatsa pfitsokala apfino mbaka tsuwachi?” <verse eid="DAN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DAN 12:7" />Imunu ayula iyemile mchanya mwa ghamatsi gha ghumto iyapfalile tsinguwo tsinzelu kenula ghamoko ghake kulanga kelaha kwa ayula iyali mgima ghamatsuwa ghose kalonga, “Itsakuwa miyaka midatu na miyetsi sita haghotsomala ghamaghayo gha iwanu iwelile, baho aghano ghose haghotsotimila.” <verse eid="DAN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DAN 12:8" />Tsanihulika lekeni tsasimanyile baye. Apfo nighutsa, “Mndewa wangu, aghano haghotsomala itsakuwatse?”<verse eid="DAN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DAN 12:9" />Naye kanyidika kalonga, “Danyeli uka ahano, kwaapfila imbuli aino ipfisika ghendo, na ikighwa muhuli mbaka matsuwa gha ukutsigha ghapfike. <verse eid="DAN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DAN 12:10" />Wanu wengi watsodeghetetsighwa, watsohopfughighwa na watsotendighwa wele. Lekeni iwanu iwehile watsoghendelela ukutenda ghehile, na mna wawo kuduhu hata yumwe iyatsomanya chayotenda Imulungu, ila iwanu wana ihekima wawo iwotsomanya.<verse eid="DAN 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DAN 12:11" />“Kulawa hawatsotenda tsinambiko tsa ukulakatsighwa tsileke ukughendelela mbaka ukutenda ing'anda ya Imulungu ihe, itsakuwa matsuwa elufu imwe, miya mbili na tisini. <verse eid="DAN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DAN 12:12" />Katsobweda gheno imunu ayula iyobetetsa mbaka matsuwa elufu imwe, na miya tatu na selasini na tano ghatimile.<verse eid="DAN 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DAN 12:13" />“Lekeni ghweghwe Danyeli ghenda ukabwihile, matsuwa agho haghatsopfika ghweghwe kutsotsilihuka na kutsopata ghweko lyako.”<verse eid="DAN 12:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DAN 12" />
</usx>